  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ Aneeñe Usʌñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ntọọñọ eti etob a-abañake Yisọs a-adooho Krais, Ayịn Abasi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed inieghe Ayịn Abasi</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />kpa naña ewet ke ñwed prọfed Aisaiya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Ami ñyaanọ isʌñutom mmi nọ ubem fiin iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">a-adiikidiọñ usʌñ inịm unọ fiin,”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“uyio awo andikoot ke anaan abo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Idiọñ usʌñ inọ Abọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">inam nnen-nnen usʌñ inọ anye.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ke ntom ke Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ akebiọññọ ke anaan, adikwọrọ uduọkmmọọñ adikappa esịd, nọ efeen mme idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Afịd abio esịd idʌñ Yudia ye afịd mbon awo ke Yeruselem emaewuọñọ ekaa ebịne anye. Ke ammọ emaekeyaara mme idiọọkñkpọ ammọ, anye amaaduọk ammọ mmọọñ ke Inyañ Yọdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yọọn akesịne afọñ e-ekedatta ided kamel enam, ye ñkpaha ikpa ke isịn amọ, ndin ndidia amọ akedo ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ ye adanakwọọk. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Etob a-anye akenọọhọ ado ami: “Anye a-adiidi anie adudu añkan miin, ami ndotto adinʌhọ ntat idʌk ikpaukod amọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ami ñkama mmọọñ inịm ndufo uduọkmmọọñ ado anye adiiduọk ndufo mmọọñ ye Adisana Sịbidịd.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uduọkmmọọñ ye Idomo Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ke ini ado, Yisọs amaato Nasared ke Kalili adi ndin Yọọn amaanyʌñ aduọk anye mmọọñ ke Yọdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ke ini Yisọs akesañake awuọ ke mmọọñ, anye amaakịt nte hefịn abakka iba ye naña Adisana Sịbidịd asọiyọ nte ibiom adoro anye ke iwuod. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ndin uyio amaato hefịn ate: “Afo ado Ayịn mmi, a-ami mmaaha eti-eti; mmenekke nnem esịd ye afo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Idaha-idaha ado, Sịbidịd amaaben anye akaa anaan, ndin <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />anye akeba ke anaan usen aba, ndin Setan amaanyʌñ adomo anye idomo. Anye akeba do ye mme ndiọi unam ikọd, ndin mme enyere emaese ñkpọ ebaña anye.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Asuan Eti Etob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ke emaekesịn Yọọn ke ufọk ñkpakọb, Yisọs amaakaa Kalili, akekwọrọ eti etob Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ukwọrọikọ amọ akedo, <char style="wj">“Ini a-adi. Abioubọọñ Abasi a-akpere. Ikappa esịd inyʌñ inịm eti etob ke akpanikọ!”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akoot mme Akpa Mbed Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Naña Yisọs akesañake ke mben Akpainyañ Kalili, anye amaakịt Saimọn ye ayịneka amọ Andru naña etop iyịre esịn ke ibiok, sia ammọ ekedo mme akọiyak. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Idi, iñkeene miin, ndin ami ñyaidọñ ndufo ekekọ mbon awo.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Inikeed-inikeed, ammọ emaekpọñ iyịre ammọ enyʌñ ekeene anye.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Anye ikisañake inyọọñ usʌñ ke anye akekịtte Yems, ayịn Sebidi, ye ayịneka amọ Yọọn ke ubom nte esʌk ediọñ iyịre ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Yisọs ikibiatta ini adikoot ammọ, ammọ ñko ikibiatta ini adikpọñ ete ammọ, Sebidi ke ubom, ye mbon utom ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkeene Yisọs.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abịn Idiọọk Sịbidịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ammọ emaekaa Kapanum, ndin akediwuọ usen Sabad, Yisọs amaadʌk akaa sinakọk anyʌñ aketọọñọ adikpeep ñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ukpeebñkpọ amọ amaakpa mme awo idem sia anye akekpeep ammọ nte awo a-anieghe adudu, idooho nte mme andikpeeb mbed. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Kpa idahado awodeen keed ke sinakọk a-akenieghe idiọọk sịbidịd amaasio ñkpo ate, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Nsoo ke ayem ye ñnyịn, Yisọs Ayịn Nasared? Afo amedi adisobo ñnyịn? Mmediọọñọ awo se afo ado: Adisana Ayịn Abasi!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yisọs amaaduat anye ke akpọsọñ uyio ate: <char style="wj">“Dop uyio. Wuọ anye ke idem!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ndedeghe sịbidịd ami amaatuak awo ami afai-afai, abọọñ akpọsọñ ñkpo anyʌñ awuọ akpọñ anye.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Idem amaakpa afịd awo tutu ammọ ebịp emọ-emọ ate, “Nsoo ido ami? Ufa ukpeeb a-asañake ye adudu! Tutu anye asinọ mme ndiọi sịbidịd uyio, ammọ enyʌñ ekop!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Etob amọ amaasuana usọp-usọp akanna afịd ñkanñkʌk Kalili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Uwak Awo Udọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ammọ ekesʌk ekpọkpọñ sinakọk, ammọ emaesaña ye Yems ye Yọọn ekaa ufọk Saimọn ye Andru. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Eka anwaan Saimọn akenaana ke ikʌk sia anye akenie ufiobidem, ndin ammọ emaekedọkkọ Yisọs ebaña anye. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Ndin Yisọs amaakaa akemʌm anye ubọk anyʌñ anwam anye adakka ada. Ufiobidem ado amaakweeñe anye, ndin anye amaadakka ada akenam ndidia anọ ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ndubiayio ado, ke utịn amaakesop, mme awo emaekoono afịd mbon udọñọ ye mbon se dimọn akemʌm esọk Yisọs. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Afịd awo ke abio emaedibono ke mben udọk, <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />ndin Yisọs amaakọk mme uwak awo se ikinieñe nsio-nsio udọñọ. Anye amaanyʌñ abịn uwak dimọn asịññe mme awo ke idem, ado anye ikiyakka mme dimọn etañ ikọ, sia ammọ emaediọọñọ awo se anye akedo.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abọñ Akam ke Ndobo-ndobo Itie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ke ataa ubakusen, ke ayio miikinwañake ima, Yisọs amaadakka ada, akpọñ ufọk akaa ndobo-ndobo itie, a-anye akekebọññọ akam. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Saimọn ye mme nsaña amọ emaekaa ekeyem anye, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ndin ke ammọ emaekekịt anye, emaebo anye ete: “Afịd awo esʌk uyem fiin!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Yak ñnyịn ika mme abio mfen se ikpere mmi, nọ ami ñnyʌñ ñkekwọrọ ikọ ke udo. Ke ntak ado ke ami ndi.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ndin anye amaasaaña ke afịd Kalili, akwọrọ ikọ ke mme sinakọk anyʌñ abịn mme dimọn asịññe mme awo ke idem.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Awo Akpamfia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Awo akpamfia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akpamfia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">akewuọñọ mme nsio-nsio udọñọ ñkpọnta ke ikpọkidem.</char></note> keed amaadibịne Yisọs anyʌñ atọọñọ edọñ akpeiye anye ate, “Adieke afo anyịmmeke, afo amekeme adinam nọ ami nsana.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Esịd amaaduọ Yisọs, mbọm anyʌñ anam anye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ataa uwak ikpañwed ebo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mbom amaanam </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yisọs</char></note> Anye amaanyan ubọk amọ atuuk awo akpamfia ami ate, <char style="wj">“Ami mmenyịmme, sana!”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Kpa idahado, akpamfia amaakweeñe anye, ndin anye amaasana.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yisọs amaasio awo akpamfia ado unyọñ ini keed anyʌñ adʌt anye utọñ ate: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" /><char style="wj">“Kịt bo ke utañña ñkpọ ami unọ awo ndomokeed. Ado kaa ke wọt aku idem mfo nyʌñ nam mme uwa naña Moses aketemme ke awo akpamfia amaasana, nte ñkpọ ntiense nọ ammọ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Utu ke ado, awo ami amaaketañ anwa-anwa se Yisọs akenam anọ anye. Ke ntak ami, Yisọs ikikanna idʌk mme abio aba anwa-anwa, ado akappa akeba ke mme ndịbe-ndịbe itie. Kpayeado, mme awo ke afịd itie ekesʌk edidi ebịne anye.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Afeen Anyʌñ Akọk Awo Akpaubeñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ñkpọ nte usen ifañ amaakeboiyo, Yisọs amaatịmme akaa Kapanum, ndin etob amaanyʌñ asuana ate ke anye adi ufọk. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Mme awo e-ekediighe ikịt anye emaewak tutu ufañ ikibaaha ke ufọk, ukpọk ke esiin, ndin anye amaakwọrọ ikọ anọ ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Mbon awo emaeben awo akpaubeñ keed, i-ideen inaañ ekebenne esọk anye. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Sia mme awo ekewakka ebọhọ, ammọ ikikanna inam nọ awo akpaubeñ ami akịt Yisọs; ke ntoro ammọ emaeyaara akọm anyọñ itie a-Yisọs akedaaha enyʌñ esuuk awo akpaubeñ ado ke aya a-anye akenaaha. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yisọs akekịt mbuọdidem ammọ, anye amaabo awo akpaubeñ ado ate: <char style="wj">“Ayịn, e-efeen mme ndiọiñkpọ mfo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ubaak mme akpeeb mbed e-eketieghe ke itie ado, emaekere ke esịd ammọ ete: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ntak awo ami atañña ikọ ntom-o? Anye asuuk Abasi uyio! Anie awo ikeme adifeen ndiọiñkpọ ke mmiibọhọke Abasi ikpọọñ?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Idaha-idaha ado, Yisọs amaadiọọñọ ke sịbidịd amọ ke se ammọ ekekere ke esịd ammọ adodo, ke ntoro anye amaanyʌñ abo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ntak a-ndufo ekereke utọ mme ñkpọ ami-e?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" /><char style="wj">Anye akee imem ikan: adibo awo akpaubeñ ami, ‘Efeen mme ndiọiñkpọ mfo,’ me adibo, ‘Dakka da, ben aya mfo nyʌñ saña’?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" /><char style="wj">Ado ami ñyem inam ndufo ediọọñọ ke Ayịn Awo anie adudu ke isọñ adifeen mme idiọọkñkpọ.”</char> Ndin anye amaabo awo akpaubeñ ate, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" /><char style="wj">“Ami ubo fiin, dakka da, ben aya mfo nyọñ ufọk.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Anye amaadakka ada ke iso afịd ammọ, aben aya amọ asaña anyọñ. Ami amaakpa afịd awo idem, ammọ emaenyʌñ etooro Abasi ete, “Kpaanam ñnyịn ikịtte utọ ñkpọ ntom!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akoot Lifai Anyʌñ Adia Ñkpọ ye mme Anam Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yisọs amaamaana awuọ akeba akpere ibiok Kalili. Uwak atu awo emaekeene anye, anye amaanyʌñ atọọñọ adikpeep ammọ ñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Naña anye akesʌkkọ asaña do, anye amaakịt Lifai, ayịn Afiọs naña atie ke atayad ubọ taks. Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ñkeene miin,”</char> ndin Lifai amaadakka ada akeene anye.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ndin naña Yisọs akebaaha ke itie ndidia ke ufọk Lifai, uwak mme abọọ taks ye mme anam ndiọiñkpọ emaekeene Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ edia ñkpọ, sia uwak mbon awo emaekeene anye. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Ke ini mme andikpeeb mbed e-ekedoññoke mme Farisi ekekịtte nte anye adia ñkpọ ye mme anam idiọọkñkpọ ye mme abọọ taks, ammọ emaebịp mme mbed amọ ete: “Ntak eteufọk ndufo asidiaha ndidia ye mme abọọ taks ye ndiọi awo-o?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yisọs akekop ami, anye amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Idooho mbon nsọñidem esiyem abiaibọk, ado mbon se idem imiisọññọ. Ami ñkidiighe adikoot ndinen awo, ado ñkedi nnọ ndiọi awo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebịp Yisọs Mbịme Ebaña Utreudia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Mme mbed Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ ye mme Farisi ekeba ke utreudia. Ado amaanam mbon awo emaedibịp Yisọs ete, “Ntak a-adooho mme mbed Yọọn ye ake mme Farisi esitre udia, ado mbed mfo, itreke-e?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Isenawo ebendọ ekpenam die etre ndidia ke ini ebendọ abaaha ye ammọ? Ikemekekeme, adaña ini nte anye abaaha ye ammọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" /><char style="wj">Ado ini ayaadi e-ediiben ebendọ idakka ikpọñ ammọ, ini ado ndin ke ammọ ediitre udia.</char><verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />
    <char style="wj">“Awo ndomokeed isibenne ufa afọñ ikịm idian ke akaan afọñ. Akpenam ntoro, ufa ayaawaak akaan afọñ anam anye awakka adiọọk akan naña akedo akpa.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" /><char style="wj">Ñko awo ndomokeed inwaññake ufa ukọd idọñ ke ñkaan ikịm. Akpenam ntoro, ukọd ado ayaaduat mme ikịm abom, ndin ukọd ye mme ikịm eyaetak. Iyoo, esinwañña ufa ukọd edọñ ke ufa ikịm.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ado Abọọñ Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Usen Sabad keed Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ ekesaña eboiyo ke inwañ mfịd. Nte ammọ ekesañake eboiyo, mme mbed amọ emaetọọñọ adikịppe mme mfịd. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mme Farisi emaebo anye ete, “Ka se, nsoo ido nọ ammọ enam ñkpọ se mbed akpan ke usen Sabad?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Kpaanam ndufo ikoodo se Defid akenam naña abiọọñ akedọññọ anye ye mme nsaña amọ, e-ekenyʌññọ eba ke unana?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><char style="wj">Anye amaadʌk ufọk Abasi ke ini Abiata akedooho ekamba aku, amaanyʌñ aben adisana uyo ata, a-adooho mbed abo ke mme aku ikpọọñ enie unen adita. Anye amaanyʌñ anọ mme nsaña amọ ubaak nọ ekeene eta.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Akem anye amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ekenam Sabad enọ awo, ikinamma awo inọ Sabad.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" /><char style="wj">Ke ntak ami, Ayịn Awo ado Abọọñ kpa ke Sabad.”</char><verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Udọñọ ke Usen Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ini mfen Yisọs amaatịmme akaa sinakọk, ndin awo keed a-akenieghe ñkpaikpa ubọk amaaba do. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Usʌk awo e-ekeyemme ntak adidot Yisọs ikọ, mmọdo ekeba ñko, ndin ammọ emaenekke ewuuk anyen ese me anye ayaakọk awo ado udọñọ ke usen Sabad. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yisọs amaabo awo a-akenieghe ñkpaikpa ubọk ate, <char style="wj">“Dakka da ke iso afịd awo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ndin Yisọs amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Anye akee ke mbed abo enam ke Sabad: Adinam eti ñkpọ me adinam idiọọk, adinyaaña uwem me adiwowot?”</char> Ado ammọ ikisioho uyio.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Anye ndin amaakanna ase ammọ ke iyadesịd, afʌhọ eti-eti ke ntak isọñesịd ammọ, anyʌñ abo awo ado ate, <char style="wj">“Nyanna ubọk mfo.”</char> Anye amaanyanna, ndin ubọk amọ amaamaana akappa adeghe ataa afịd-afịd. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Idaha-idaha ado mme Farisi emaewuọñọ ke itie ubọñ akam enyʌñ eketọọñọ adidʌk edioomo ye mbon ñka Herọd naña ammọ ekpesaña ewot Yisọs.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Atu Awo Ekeene Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ emaekpọñ ekaa ibiok, ndin uwak atu awo emaeto Kalili ekeene anye. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Mme awo ekekop afịd se anye akenam, uwak awo emaeto Yudia, Yeruselem, Idumia ye mme ñkanñkʌk ukañ Yọdan ye mme ukañ Tai ye Sidọn edibịne anye. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ke ntak atu awo ami, anye amaabo mme mbed amọ ate yak ebọ etək ubom enịm inọ imọ, mbaak mme atu awo edifiik imọ. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Sia anye amaakọk uwak awo udọñọ, mme adọñọ nsio-nsio udọñọ emaenək idem edi iso nọ ekan etuuk anye. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ini keed akeedodo a-mme ndedeghe sịbidịd ekekịtte anye, ammọ emaeduọññọ ke isọñ ke iso amọ ebọñ ñkpo ete, “Afo ado Ayịn Abasi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ado anye amaadʌt ammọ utọñ ate ammọ ekuyaara ake imọ ido inọọ mbon mfen.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Amek Mbed Duob mme Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yisọs amaadọọk anyọñ mben ekamba abod anyʌñ akekoot mbon se anye akeyem, ndin ammọ emaedi ebịne anye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Anye amaamek awo duob mme iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ete, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">duob mme iba, ake ediọọñọke nte me abọsịd</char></note> e-ediiba ye anye, mbon a-anye adiinyʌñ idọñ nọ ekekwọrọ ikọ Abasi; <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ediinyʌñ inie adudu adibịn mme dimọn nsịññe awo ke idem.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Awo duob mme iba a-anye akemekke edoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 3:16" />
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Saimọn (a-anye akenyʌññọ anọ anyịñ Pita),<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yems, ayịn Sebidi ye ayịneka amọ awodeen Yọọn (a-anye akenọọhọ ammọ anyịñ Bonekes, awuọñọke “nditọ aduma”),<verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andru,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Filib,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Batolomiu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Matiu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tọmọs,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Yems ayịn Alfiọs,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tadiọs,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Saimọn a-akedooho Amaidʌñ,<verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ye Yudas Iskariọd, andikitap anye nnọọ ñkpa.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edot Yisọs Uyio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ke ini Yisọs amaakedʌk ufọk keed, mme atu awo emaemaana ediboho do tutu anye ye mme mbed amọ ikikanna idia ukpọk ndidia. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ubon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbon nsaña amọ</char></note> amọ ekekop ami, ammọ emaekaa adikpeme anye sia ammọ ekebo, “Iwuod aboiyo anye.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ndin mme akpeeb mbed e-eketooho Yeruselem emaebo ete, “Belsibọb asịne anye ke idem. Anye adat adudu akpan abọọñ mme dimọn abịn mme dimọn asịññe awo ke idem.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Do ke Yisọs akekoot ammọ nọ esaña ekpere anye anyʌñ atọọñọ aditañ ikọ nnọọ ammọ ke ñke ate: <char style="wj">“Setan akeme die adibịn setan nsio?</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" /><char style="wj">Adieke abioubọọñ abakkake ada anwana ye idem amọ, abioubọọñ ado idikanna isọọñọ ida.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" /><char style="wj">Adieke ufọk anieghe ubakka, ufọk ado idikanna ida ñko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" /><char style="wj">Ñko adieke Setan anwanake ye idem amọ, anye idiikanna isọọñọ ida: awuọ utịd amọ adikem.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" /><char style="wj">Ke akpanikọ awo ndomokeed ikanna adidʌk ufọk akpọsọñ awo ibọhọke anye abem iso abọp akpọsọñ awo ado. Do ndin ke anye adiikan ibịme ñkpọ ke ufọk awo ado ikoono.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" /><char style="wj">Ke akpanikọ ke ami idọkkọ ndufo, eyaefeen afịd ndiọiñkpọ ye afịd atịme-atịme ikọ adidọk a-mme awo etañña, </char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><char style="wj">ado awo akeedodo a-atañña atịme-atịme ikọ emiom adian Adisana Sịbidịd, awo idiifeene idiọọkñkpọ amọ sia ammọ enie ubiomikpe nsi-nsi idiọọkñkpọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yisọs aketañ ami sia ammọ ekebo, “Anye anie ndedeghe sịbidịd.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ndin eka ye nditọeka ideen Yisọs emaediwuọ. Ammọ ekeda ke anwa esiin, edọñ awo akekoot anye inọ mmimọ. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Atu awo se ikitie ikanna anye emaebo anye ete, “Eka mfo ye nditọeka mfo ideen esʌk uyem ke anwa esiin.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yisọs amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Mme anie ido eka ye nditọeka mmi ideen?”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ndin anye amaasuan anyen aseet mme awo e-eketieghe ekanna anye ekʌk, anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Eka mmi ye nditọeka mmi ideen edoñño ami!</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anamma uduak Abasi ado ayịneka mmi awodeen ye ayịneka mmi awonwaan ye eka mmi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ñke Atọinwañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ini mfen Yisọs amaamaana akpeep ñkpọ ke mben ibiok. Atu awo e-ekekannake anye ekʌk amaakpon tutu adido se anye akedʌk ubom ke ibiok atie, ke ini afịd mme awo ekedudakka ke esʌk. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Anye akekpeep ammọ uwak ñkpọ ke ñke, ke ukpeebñkpọ amọ anye amaabo ntom: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" /><char style="wj">“Ikpañ utọñ! Atọinwañ keed akekaa itọ ñkpasi ke inwañ amọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" /><char style="wj">Naña anye akesuanna ñkpasi ado, usʌk emaeduọññọ ke akpọusʌñ, ndin mme inuen edikoono ammọ etaha.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" /><char style="wj">Usʌk emaeduọññọ ke mme isọñ itiad, i–imiifọnnọ ñkpọ. Ammọ emaetịppe usọp-usọp, sia isọñ ikitʌñọke.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" /><char style="wj">Ke ini utịn amaakedisakka adimia ammọ, ammọ emaeyeeme sia ammọ ikinieghe adʌñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" /><char style="wj">Usʌk ñkpasi ekeduọññọ ke ikọd ñkukịm, e-ekekọttọ efʌk ammọ, anam ammọ ikinieghe mfịd.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" /><char style="wj">Kpayeado mme ñkpasi mfen emaeduọññọ ke eti isọñ. Ammọ emaetịppe, ekọọt, enyʌñ enwịm abek mfịd akewakka, usʌk edịb mme duob, usʌk ata, usʌk ikie.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ, yak anye akop.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Akem ke ini Yisọs akebaaha ikpọọñ ke idem amọ, mme mbed duob mme iba ye mbon e-ekebaaha ekpere anye emaebịp anye ñkpọ ebaña mme ñke ado. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Anye amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“E-eyaak mme ndedịbe ñkpọ abioubọọñ Abasi inọ ndufo. Ado amaado mbon mfen, etañ afịd ñkpọ ke ñke enọ ammọ</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><char style="wj">nọ ato do,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ammọ ekeme edikekịt ado idiọọñọke,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">enyʌñ ekokop ado inwañake ammọ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">miidooho ammọ ekeme ikappa esịd ndin ato do efeen enọ ammọ.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ñke ami inwañake ndufo? Ñke mfen adiinam die inwaña ndufo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" /><char style="wj">Atọ inwañ ke ñke ami atọ ikọ Abasi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" /><char style="wj">Usʌk awo eba nte ñkpasi e-eduọññọke ke akpọusʌñ ke emaetọ ikọ Abasi. Ammọ emaesʌk ekokop ikọ Abasi, Setan adi adiben ikọ e-eketọọhọ ke esịd ammọ afep.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" /><char style="wj">Mbio mfen eba nte ñkpasi e-etọọhọ ke isọñ itiad, ammọ ekop ikọ Abasi enyʌñ enem esịd ke ataa idaha ekoppo do.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" /><char style="wj">Ado sia ammọ imiinieghe adʌñ, ikọ Abasi ikpeeneke ke esịd ammọ. Mfịna ye ndutʌhọ emaedi ke ntak ikọ Abasi, ammọ eduọññọ usọp-usọp.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" /><char style="wj">Ñko mbon mfen etie nte ñkpasi e-eduọññọke ke ikọd ñkukịm, ammọ ekop ikọ Abasi;</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" /><char style="wj">ado mfịna ederimbod, ye abiaña a-atooho inie ye udọñ nsio-nsio ñkpọ mfen edʌk edi, edikọt efʌk ikọ Abasi, efiik ikọ, iyakka anye anwịm mfịd.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" /><char style="wj">Ndin mbon mfen etie nte ñkpasi e-etọọhọ ke eti isọñ. Ammọ edo mbon ekoppo ikọ Abasi, ebọ anye, enyʌñ enwịm mme abek mfịd e-ewakka, usʌk edịb mme duob, usʌk ata, usʌk akañ ikie akan se eketọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utuenikañ ke Udodutuenikañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo esidomo utuenikañ eben usan efʌk me esinịm ke idak ikʌk? Ndufo isidomoke ikañ iben idot ke ñkpọ udod utuenikañ?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><char style="wj">Sia ñkpọ keed akeedodo e-edịppedịp, eyaeyaara, se adodo e-efʌkkọfʌk eyaefʌkkọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe utọñ, yak anye akop.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Ndin Yisọs amaakaa iso atañ ate: <char style="wj">“Inekke itʌm ikere se ndufo ekop ami. Se adodo a-ndufo edomoke enọọ awo, kpa ado ke ediidomo inọ ndufo, mmiidooho akan se ndufo ekedomo enọọ awo mfen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><char style="wj">Awo akeedodo a-anieghe ñkpọ, eyaemaana edian enọ anye, ado awo i-imiinieghe, eyaebọ idem se anye akenenie.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñke Ñkpasi e-Etọọhọ ke Inwañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Ñko anye amaamaana abo, <char style="wj">“Abioubọọñ Abasi aba nte awo a-asuanna ñkpasi ke isọñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" /><char style="wj">Akonayio ye uweemeayio, me anye adadaiya, me adedemme-o, ñkpasi ado asʌk atịppe anyʌñ akọt, akpesʌkado anye imiidiọọñọke naña asaña.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" /><char style="wj">Isọñ ke idem amọ ikpọọñ anam abakpa anwịm idem, emịne atịppe, akema iwuod awuọ ada, ke akpatre afịd idem ye mfịd ewuọñọ eda.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" /><char style="wj">Mfịd amaakedat, atọ inwañ aban ikwa adakka adikpịkke sia ini idọk akem.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñke Ñkpasi Mọstad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Anye amaamaana abo, <char style="wj">“Ñnyịn idiibo ke abioubọọñ Abasi aba nte nsoo ñkpọ, me idiidat nsoo utọ ñke itañ iwọt naña abioubọọñ aba?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" /><char style="wj">Anye aba nte ñkpasi mọstad, a-adooho andisịp ñkan ke atu afịd ñkpasi ke ederimbod.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" /><char style="wj">Ado emaetọ ema, anye atịppe, akọt anyʌñ akpon akan afịd mme eto inwañ, anyʌñ anieñe ataa ikpọ ñkọk tutu adido se mme inuen anyọñ edi edisọrọ ke mfuud amọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yisọs amaadat uwak ñke ntom akwọrọ ikọ Abasi anọ ammọ akeene naña akenwaña ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Anye ikitañña ikọ ndomokeed inọ ammọ ke miidooho ke ñke. Ado ini se anye akeba ikpọọñ ye mme mbed amọ, anye amaanam afịd ñkpọ anwaña ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Asua Anọ Ayobio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ke ndubiayio usen ado, anye amaabo mme mbed amọ ate, <char style="wj">“Yak ñnyịn iwọññọ ika edem uko.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ke ammọ emaekekpọñ mme atu awo, mme mbed amọ emaeben anye edakka ke ubom, kpa naña anye akesaña. Mme ubom mfen emaeba do ñko ye anye. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ataa akpọsọñ ayobio amaatọọñọ tutu udakka akpa mmọọñ abʌññọ adʌk ubom akpere adiyọhọ esịd ubom. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Afịd ini ami, Yisọs akeba ke itak ubom asʌk adaiya ke udodiwuod. Ndin mme mbed amọ emaeketọi anye ke idab ebo anye ate, “Andikpeeb, awuọ ubegheke fiin adieke ñnyịn ideññe?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Anye amaademme, asua anọ ayobio anyʌñ abo mbufuud akpa mmọọñ ate, <char style="wj">“Dop! Naa sʌñ!”</char> Ndin ayobio amaatre, afịd ñkpọ anyʌñ adobo biai.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Anye amaabo mme mbed amọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ntak i-idem inyeññe ndufo ntom-o? Ndufo isʌkkọ inenie mbuọdidem?”</char><verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Akpọsọñ ndịk amaanam afịd ammọ, ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ ebiime emọ-emọ ete, “Anie awo ido ami? Kpa afịm ye mme mbufuud akpa mmọọñ ekop uyio amọ!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Awo a-Anieghe Dimọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ emaeboiyo ekewuọ edem ibiok ke ñkañ Kerasin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ebo, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbon Kadarin</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; usʌk ete </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbon Keekesin</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ke Yisọs amaakewuọ ke ubom, awo a-akenieghe idiọọk sịbidịd amaawuọ ato ke utịd ukañ mme udi ubuuk awo ekebaaha adisoobo ye anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Awo ami akedʌñ ke itie ubuuk awo, ndin awo ndomokeed ikikanna ibọp anye ke ñkpọnọ item itie keed. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ataa uwak ini, emaebọp anye ubọk ye ukod ke ñkpọnọ item, anye amaasikịp mme ñkpọnọ anyʌñ akpək afịd ukwak ke ukod ye ubọk amọ. Ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-akenieghe adudu adikan mbọp anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Afịd akonayio ye uweemeayio, ke itie ubuuk awo ami ye ñkanñkʌk abod, awo ami amaasibọọñ ñkpo anyʌñ akama itiad akpək idem amọ.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ke ini anye amaakeda akịt Yisọs ke anyan usʌñ, anye amaafeghe aketọọñọ edọñ ke iso Yisọs. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Ndin anye amaasio ñkpo ke afịd adudu amọ, ate “Nsoo ke afo ayem anto miin, Yisọs Ayịn Andikoñ Ñkan Abasi Ibom? Mmuukpeiye fiin ke anyịñ Abasi mbo kuntʌkkọ miin!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Anye aketañ ami sia Yisọs amaakebo anye, <char style="wj">“Wuọ kpọñ awo ami, afo idiọọk sịbidịd!”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Akem Yisọs amaabịp anye ate, <char style="wj">“Afo akere die?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñkere Liyọn, sia ñnyịn imiiwak.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ndin anye amaakpeiye amaana akpeiye Yisọs ate anye akiibịn mmimọ asịññe ke ñkanñkʌk ado.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Mme uwak udịm edi ekesʌk edia ñkpọ ke ñkpere etək abod. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Mme sịbidịd ado emaekpeiye Yisọs ete, “Inọ ñnyịn ikidʌk idọñọ ke idem mme edi ako.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Anye amaanọ ammọ unyịmme, ndin mme ndiọi sịbidịd ado emaewuọñọ ekedọñọ ke mme edi ado. Udịm edi e-ekewakka ñkpọ nte tọsịn iba emaebịmme efeeñe ediatta ke abedeñ ibiok ado enyʌñ ekekpañña edọñọ ke mmọọñ.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Mme akpeme edi ado emaefeeñe ekebʌk se ikitịppe enọ mbon abio ado ye ke ñkanñkʌk ado, ndin mme awo emaewuọọñọ ekaa adikise se ikitịppe. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ke ini ammọ emaekedisoobo Yisọs, ammọ emaekịt awodeen ado a-akenieghe uwak dimọn naña asịne afọñ atie nte awo i-iwuod afọnnọ; ndin idem amaanyeñ ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Mbon se ikikịt ñkpọ ami emaedọkkọ mbon mfen se ikitịppe inọ awo a-dimọn aketʌkkọke, ye se ikitịppe inọ mme edi ñko. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Mbon awo ndin emaekpeiye Yisọs ebo akpọñ ñkanñkʌk mmimọ.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Naña Yisọs akeyemme idʌk ubom, awo a-dimọn akemʌmmọ amaakpeiye ate yak imọ ikeene anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ado Yisọs ikinyịmmeke, utu ke ado Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Tịmme nyọñ ufọk bịne mbon mfo nyʌñ ke dọkkọ ammọ se Abọọñ anam unọọ ye naña anye utua fiin mbọm.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Awo ado amaanyọñ akebʌk ke mme abio Dekapolis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho, Mme Abio Duob</char></note> se Yisọs akenam inọọ imọ. Ndin idem amaakpa afịd mbon awo.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anam Abọikpa Aset ke Ñkpa anyʌñ Akọk Awonwaan Udọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ke ini Yisọs amaakeboiyo ke ubom akewuọ edem ibiok uko, ekamba atu awo emaedida ekanna anye ekʌk idaha a-anye abaaha ke mben ibiok ado. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ndin adaaha keed ke atu mme adaaha ke sinakọk a-akekereke Yairọs amaadi, ndin ke anye akekịtte Yisọs, anye amaaduọ ke ukod Yisọs, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />anyʌñ akpeiye anye ate, “Etəkayịn mmi awonwaan akpere ñkpa. Mbọk di didot anye ubọk ke idem nọ anye akop nsọñidem anyʌñ adu uwem.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ndin Yisọs amaakeene anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Ekamba atu awo emaekeene anye enyʌñ enək anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ndin amaaba awonwaan keed akedọñọke udọñọ uwuọiyiib ke isua duob mme iba. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Anye amaabọ ufen eti-eti ke ubọk uwak mbiaibọk anyʌñ abiat afịd akʌk se anye akenie, ado utu ke idem asọsọñ anye, akeneenekke adiọọk akan naña akedo. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ke anye amaakekop abaña Yisọs, anye amaato edem-edem asaña ke atu mme awo anyʌñ aketuuk afọñidem Yisọs, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />sia anye amaakere abo, “Ami ñkpesʌk ntuuk afọñidem amọ, ami ñyaakop nsọñidem.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kpa ke idaha a-anye aketuuhọ afọñ Yisọs, udọñọ uwuọiyiib ado amaakweeñe anye, anye amaanyʌñ akop ke idem amọ ke imọ imibọkkọ mfịna imọ.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kpa ke ukem idahado Yisọs amaadiọọñọ ke adudu iwuọ imọ ke idem. Anye amaakanna iso ke atu awo ado anyʌñ abịp ate, <char style="wj">“Anie awo ikituuk afọñ mmi?”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Mme mbed amọ emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Ñkọ afo amekịt atu awo se ukanna fiin ikʌk, ado afo atịmme abịp ate <char style="wj">‘Anie awo ikiintuuk?’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ado Yisọs amaakaa iso asʌk asuan anyen adikịt andikituuk anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ndin awonwaan ado amaakediọọñọ se ikitịppe inọọ imọ, amaawuọ adiduọ ke ukod Yisọs ke ñnyeñidem ye ndịk, ndin anye amaatañ afịd akpanikọ anọ anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo anye ate: <char style="wj">“Yịn awonwaan, mbuọdidem mfo u-ukọk fiin. Nyọñ ke emem, nyʌñ bọkkọ ukuud mfo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ke idaha Yisọs akesʌkkọ atañ ikọ do, mme awo emaeto ufọk Yairọs, adadusʌñ ke sinakọk, edibo anye ete, “Ayịn abọikpa mfo akpa. Ntak afo asʌkkọ afịna Andikpeeb-e?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ke Yisọs amaakekop se ibon ado eketañ, anye amaabo adadusʌñ ke sinakọk ate, <char style="wj">“Kuuyak idem unyeñ; kap nịm ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Anye ikiyakka awo ndomokeed, ibọhọke Pita, Yems ye Yọọn, ayịneka Yems akeene anye. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ke ini ammọ emaekedisịm ufọk adadusʌñ ke sinakọk, Yisọs amaakịt akpọsọñ ndutịme ye naña mme awo etuaha enyʌñ ebọọñ ñkpo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Anye amaadʌk ufọk anyʌñ abịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ntak afịd ndutịme ye ñkpo ami-e? Ayịn ami ikpaahakpa, adadaiya.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ado ammọ ekesaasaha anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Ke anye amaakenam afịd awo ewuọñọ, anye amaadat ete ye eka ayịn ye mme mbed e-ekebaaha ye anye adʌk akaa itie nte ayịn akenaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yisọs amaamʌm anye ubọk anyʌñ abo anye ate, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Talita koum!”</char></char> (awuọñọke <char style="wj">“Etək abọikpa, ami ubo fiin, dakka da!”</char>). <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Idaha-idaha ado, ayịn ado, a-akedooho isua duob mme iba, amaadakka ada anyʌñ atọọñọ isaña ñkanna. Idem amaanekke akpa mme awo adikịt utọ ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ado anye amaanekke awuuk ammọ ate ammọ ekuunam awo ndomokeed adiọọñọ abaña ñkpọ ami. Anye amaanyʌñ abo yak ammọ enọ ayịn abọikpa ado ndidia nọ adia.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Prọfed i-Imiinieghe Ukpono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yisọs amaakpọñ itie ado ye mme mbed amọ akaa idʌñ amọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Akekem ke usen Sabad, anye amaatọọñọ adikpeep ñkpọ ke sinakọk, ndin idem amaakpa uwak awo se ikikop ukpeebñkpọ amọ; ammọ emaenyʌñ ebịp ete,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">“Ke mmọọ ke awo ami akedat afịd ukpeeb ami ato? Nsoo utọ aniọñ ke enọ anye ami? Nsoo ido utọ ñwuọnda utịppeñkpọ a-anye anamma ami? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Idooho akabinta ado ami? Idooho ayịn Mmeri ado ami, ayịneka awodeen Yems, Yosef<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yoses</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yosef</char></note>, Yudas ye Saimọn? Nte nditọeka amọ ibaan ibaaha mi ye ñnyịn?” Ndin ammọ emaeyat esịd ebaña anye.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Prọfed inanake ukpono ibọhọke ke abio amọ, ye ke atu mme ayakka amọ, ye ke ubon amọ.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Anye ikikanna inam mme utịppeñkpọ do, ibọhọke adidot akpọ awo ifañ ubọk ke iwuod i-idem mmiikisọññọ ñnyʌñ ñkọk ammọ udọñọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Idem amaakpa anye eti-eti ke unana mbuọdidem ammọ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yisọs Adọñ Mme Mbed Duob mme Iba Utom</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ndin Yisọs amaasaaña ke idʌñ ke idʌñ akpeep ikọ Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Akem anye amaakoot mme mbed amọ duob mme iba adọñ ammọ awo iba-iba, ndin amaanyʌñ anọ ammọ adudu adibịn mme ndedeghe sịbidịd nsịññe.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Anye amaanọ ammọ item ate, <char style="wj">“Ikiikama ñkpọ ndomokeed ke isañ ami, nte uyo, me ekpad, me akʌk ke ñkpahaisịn, ibọhọke esañ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" /><char style="wj">Isịne ikpaukod, ado ikiikama ukpʌhọ afọñidem.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" /><char style="wj">Ufọk akeedodo a-ndufo edʌkkọ, itie do tutu ndufo ekpọñ abio ado.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><char style="wj">Ndin itie akeedodo i-imiidaarake ndufo, i-imiinyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inọ ndufo, imaikpọñ ndo, ikeñ ntan ñkpad ndufo ibono nte ntiense ubiomikpe inọ ammọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Mme mbed amọ emaewuọñọ ekekwọrọ ikọ Abasi, ete yak mme awo ekappa esịd. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ebịn uwak dimọn esịññe mme awo ke idem, eyet mbon udọñọ adan enyʌñ ekọk ammọ udọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekpịkke Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ Iwuod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Adidem Herọd amaakop abaña se ikitịppe sia anyịñ Yisọs amaasuana. Usʌk emaetọọñọ etañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Anye akebo</char></note> ete, “Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ aset ke ñkpa, anye ado ntak mme utịppe adudu enamma utom ke idem amọ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Mbon mfen emaebo, “Anye ado Elaiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Usʌk mbon mfen ekekere ebo, “Anye ado prọfed, nte keed ke atu mme prọfed esed.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ado ke ini Herọd akekoppo ami, anye amaabo, “Yọọn, a-ami ñkekpịkkeke iwuod aset ke ñkpa!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Sia ado Herọd ke idem amọ akenọọ uyio ate emʌm Yọọn esịn ke ufọk ñkpakọb, anye amaanam ebọp anye ekesịn ke ñkpakọb. Anye akenam ami ke ntak Herọdias, anwaan ayịneka amọ Filib, a-anye Herọd akebenne adọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Sia Yọọn amaasidọkkọ Herọd ate, “Mbed a-akpan afo adidat anwaan ayịneka mfo ndọ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Ami akesịn Herọdias anie udu ke esịd amọ abaña Yọọn anyʌñ ayem usʌñ naña akpewot anye. Ado anye ikikịtte usʌñ adinam ntoro, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />sia Herọd amaabaak Yọọn, anyʌñ akekpeme anye ñko, sia anye amaadiọọñọ abo ke Yọọn akedo nnen-nnen ye adisana awo. Ke ini Herọd akekoppo se Yọọn aketañ, idem amaakpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anye </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">amaanam uwak-uwak ñkpọ</char></note> anye, ado kpayeado anye akesʌk amama adikpañ utọñ nnọọ Yọọn.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ke akpatre Herọdias amaanie ufañ a-anye akeyemme. Ke usen emana Herọd, anye Herọd amaanam ekamba usọrọ anọ ikpọ mbon utom amọ ke ukara, ye mme adaiso ekọñ, ye mme awuọiso awo mfen ke Kalili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ke idaha a-ayịn abọikpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ke idaha </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ayịn abọikpa amọ</char></note> Herọdias akedinekke unek ke iso Herọd, anye amaanam esịd anem Herọd ye mme isenawo amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Adidem Herọd amaabo ayịn abọikpa ami ate, “Mbeeñe ñkpọ akeedodo se afo ama, ndin ami ñyaunọ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Herọd aketañ ami ye unwọñọ ate, “Se adodo a-afo abeeñeke, ami ñyaunọ, akpedodo mbakka iba abioubọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ayịn abọikpa ami amaawuọ akebịp eka amọ ate, “Nsoo ke ami ñkpebeeñe adidem?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Eka amaabọọrọ ate, “Iwuod Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ini keed, ayịn abọikpa ado amaasọp afeghe akedọkkọ adidem ate: “Ami ñyem afo annọ miin iwuod Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ ke usan idahami.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Adidem amaafʌhọ eti-eti, ado sia akedooho enwọñọ amọ ye ke ntak mme ikpọ isenawo amọ, anye ikikanna isịn adinọ anye se anye akeyem. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ke ndo-ndo ado, adidem amaanọ awodawo adudu ate akekpịkke iwuod Yọọn aben adi. Awo ado amaakaa, akekpịkke Yọọn iwuod ke ufọk ñkpakọb, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />anyʌñ aben adi ke usan. Herọd amaabọ iwuod Yọọn anọ ayịn abọikpa ado, ndin anye amaaben asọk eka amọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ke ini mme mbed Yọọn ekekoppo etob ami, ammọ emaediben akpo Yọọn ekebuuk ke udi.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anọ Tọsịn Awo Ition Ndidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Akem mme abọsịd Yisọs emaedibono ekanna Yisọs ekʌk, enyʌñ etañ afịd ñkpọ se ammọ ekenam ye se ekekpeep enọ anye. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ndin sia akedooho uwak awo ededi enyʌñ enyọnyọñọ, ammọ ikinieghe ini se edia kpak ñkpọ, Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo iñkeene miin nọ ika ndobo-ndobo itie ikibọ nduọkadudu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ndin ammọ emaedʌk ubom ewat ekaa ndobo-ndobo itie ke idem ammọ ikpọọñ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ado uwak mbon se ikikịt idaha ammọ ekedaañake emaefeeñe abod-abod eto ke afịd mme abio ebem Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ iso ekewuọ itie ammọ ekedibegheke. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ke ini Yisọs amaakedibeghe ke isọñ, anyʌñ akịt uwak atu awo, udʌk ammọ amaanam anye sia ammọ ekeba nte mme edọñ i-imiinieghe andikpeme. Ke ntoro, anye amaatọọñọ adikpeep ammọ uwak ñkpọ.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Amaakediwuọ ini ntom ayio amaasọñ, mme mbed amọ emaedi ebịne anye edibo anye ete, “Itie ami anyọọñ usʌñ akpọñ abio, ñko ayio a-anekke asọñ. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Nam nọ mme awo ami enyọñọ nọ ammọ ekedep ñkpọ edia ke mme ñkanñkʌk esịd idʌñ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ado anye amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo inọ ammọ ñkpọ se edia.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Ammọ emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Ado adiikpa ñkpọ nte akʌk utom afiọñ itiokeed. Ñnyịn idiibiat afịd ado ke adinọ ammọ ndidia yak edia?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ikaa ikise. Eboho uyo ifañ ke ndufo enie?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Ammọ ekekekịt, ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Uyo ition ye iyak iba.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate enam nọ afịd awo etie ke eboho ke eboho ke awawa mbid. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ebono ke eboho ke eboho, usʌk ikie, usʌk aba mme duob. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yisọs amaakeben uyo ition ye iyak iba ado, anyʌñ amaabenne anyen ase hefịn, anọ Abasi ekọọm, anyʌñ abuuñ mme uyo ado, ndin anye amaayaak anọ mme mbed ate edeeme enọ mme atu awo ado. Anye amaanyʌñ abakka iyak iba ado anọ afịd ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Afịd ammọ emaedia ñkpọ enyʌñ ekop uyʌkkọ, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />ndin mme mbed emaetañ mme mbeñe uyo ye iyak se ikisʌhọ a-akeyọhọke akpasa duob mme iba. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Mme ideen se ikidia ñkpọ ekedo tọsịn ition.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Asaña ke Anyọñ Mmọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Idaha-idaha ado, Yisọs amaanam mme mbed amọ edọñọ ubom, ebem anye iso esañ ke Bedsaida ke ini anye akenamma mme atu awo ado enyọñọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ke anye amaakekpọñ ammọ, anye amaakaa anyọñ abod akebọñ akam.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ke akonayio usen ado, ubom a-mme mbed ekesañake amaakewuọ ufọọd ibiok, ado Yisọs akeba ikpọọñ ke abod. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Anye amaada akịt naña mme mbed amọ edəho ye udeñ ke esịd ubom sia afịm amaafịme eti-eti. Etək ini mbemiso ndañnsiere, anye amaasaña ke anyọñ mmọọñ ado abịne ammọ. Anye akeyem adisaña mboiyo ammọ, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ado ke ini ammọ ekekịtte naña anye asaña ke anyọñ ibiok, ammọ emaekere ke anye ado ekpo. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ebọñ ñkpo, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />sia afịd ammọ emaekịt anye ndin ndịk amaanam ammọ eti-eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Ukem idahado anye amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Isọñ esịd. Ami ke ado. Ikiifeghe ndịk.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ndin anye amaadọọk adʌk ubom ye ammọ, afịm ñko amaadobo. Idem amaanekke akpa ammọ eti-eti, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />sia utịppeñkpọ uyo ado ikinwañake ammọ, sia esịd ammọ amaadoro ufiọọn.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ammọ emaekekaaña mmọọñ ekebeghe ke Yenesaded, emaeyịt ubom ke esʌk ado. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ammọ ekesʌk ewuọwuọọñọ ke ubom, mme awo emaediọọñọ ke Yisọs ado ado. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Mme awo ndin emaefeeñe eto afịd ñkanñkʌk udo, ekoono mbon udọñọ ke aya ekaa itie nte ammọ ekekokop ke anye mmọdo aba. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Itie nte anye akekaaka, me esịd idʌñ, me abio, me inwañ, mme awo emaekoono mbon udọñọ edibono ke mme anwa udua. Ammọ emaekpeiye anye ete ayaak mmimọ ituuk akpekọm mben afọñidem amọ, ndin afịd awo se ikituuk emaekop nsọñidem.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Se Isappa Awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Akem mme Farisi ye usʌk mme akpeeb mbed e-eketooho Yeruselem emaedibono ekanna Yisọs, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />ndin emaenyʌñ ekịt naña usʌk mbed amọ edia ndidia ye mbaad ubọk, ado ado, ubọk a-awo mmiiyieghe. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Mme Farisi ye mme Yuu isidiaha ndidia ke ammọ miiyieghe ubọk; esọñ eyịre ke eduuwem mme ñkpisọñ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ñko, awo a-anyọññọ udua, ana ayie ubọk anyʌñ ayet ñkpọ se adep, miidooho ntoro inaaha adia ñkpọ ado. Ammọ enieñe uwak ido mfen nte uyed kọọb mmọọñ, ako utem ñkpọ, usan afere ye aketịd utem mmọọñ.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ndin mme Farisi ye mme akpeeb mbed emaebịp Yisọs ete, “Ntak a-mme mbed mfo imiiduuho uwem ikeene ndutʌm mme ñkpisọñ yak ammọ edia ndidia ye mbaad ubọk-ọ?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Aisaiya amaanen ke anye aketañña prọfesi ibaña ndufo mbon mbubịk; nte ewette ebo ete:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mbon ami eñkpono miin ke ñkpọkinua,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">ado esịd ammọ amaañkpọñ miin anyọọñ usʌñ.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />
    <char style="wj">Ammọ eñkpono miin ke ikpu-ikpu usʌñ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">ekeene ukpeebñkpọ ammọ a-akọñọke ke mme mbed awo.’</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ndufo emesaana mbed Abasi eyaak, enyʌñ esọọñọ emʌm ndutʌm ubonoñkpọ ubọkawo ekama.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Anye amaakaa iso adọkkọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo emekama ñkara ewọññọ ekpọñ item Abasi, nọ enie ufañ etʌmmọ edu unam ñkpọ ndufo!</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" /><char style="wj">Sia Moses akebo, ‘Kpono ete ye eka mfo,’ ndin ‘Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-asuuñọke ete me eka amọ.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" /><char style="wj">Ado ndufo ekedi, emedibo ke awo akpebo ete ye eka amọ ke se ikpikidat ifọn ndufo mfọn ado Kọọban (a-adooho, asaña-asaña enọ a-anieghe Abasi),</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" /><char style="wj">ke usʌñ ami ndufo iyakka nditọ enam ñkpọ ndomokeed enọ mme ete me eka ammọ aba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" /><char style="wj">Ntom ke ndufo ebiat ikọ Abasi, ekeene edu unamñkpọ a-ndufo enịmme, ndin ndufo emenyʌñ enam uwak ñkpọ a-akaaha ke utọ usʌñ ntom.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ndin Yisọs amaatịmme akoot atu awo abono, atañ ye ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Afịd ndufo ikpañ utọñ innọ miin inyʌñ inekke idiọọñọ ntom.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" /><char style="wj">Ñkpọ ndomokeed a-atooho adidʌk awo idem ikemeke isappa awo. Ado, ñkpọ a-atooho awo idem awuọ, anye ado se isappa awo.</char> [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><char style="wj">Awo a-anieghe utọñ adikop, yak anye akop.”</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed edọñ mme ikọ atooho Maak 4:23</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ke anye amaakekpọñ atu awo akedʌk ufọk, mme mbed amọ emaebịp anye se ñke ado awuọñọ. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ndin anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nte ndufo enana ifiọk ntom? Ndufo idiọọñọke ke se ito idʌk awo idem ikemeke isappa awo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" /><char style="wj">Sia ñkpọ ado idʌkkọ ammọ esịd ado adʌk ammọ idịb kpọd, ndin etọrọ anye esio ke idem.”</char> Yisọs aketañ ami adinam ammọ ediọọñọ ke afịd se awo adia a-asana, ibaaha anye adiọọkkọ.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Anye amaasʌk akaiso adọkkọ ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Se ito awo esịd idem iwuọ ado se isappa awo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" /><char style="wj">Sia afịd ndiọi akikere eto esịd awo ewuọñọ: Use, inọ, uwodawo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" /><char style="wj">usịn efịbe, udọrọ itọñ, idiọọkesịd, abiaña, ndukpo ido, ufịb, adidọk, ntañidem ye ndisịme.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Afịd ndiọiñkpọ ami eto esịd awo ewuọñọ enyʌñ esappa awo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akpono Mbuọdidem Awonwaan Sirofonisia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yisọs amaakpọñ itie ado akaa ñkpere abio Tai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tai </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ye Sidọn</char></note> Anye amaaboiyo adʌk ufọk keed, ndin ikiyemme awo ndomokeed adiọọñọ; ado anye ikikanna idịbe. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Awonwaan keed i-idiọọk sịbidịd akesịneke ke idem ayịn amọ awonwaan akesʌk akokop ke Yisọs mmọdo aba, anye amaadi aditọọñọ edọñ ke ukod amọ. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mma ado akedo awo Krik, a-akemanake ke Siria Fonisia. Anye amaakpeiye Yisọs ate abịn dimọn asio ke idem ayịn imọ awonwaan.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yisọs amaabo mma ado, <char style="wj">“Yak nọ ntəkayịn eto edia ñkpọ nọ ayʌkkọ ammọ, sia inenne adiben ndidia ntəkayịn ntop nnọọ mme ewa.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Awonwaan ami amaabọọrọ anye, “Abọọñ, ado mme ewa ke idak akpokoro esitañ mbeñe ndidia nditọ se iduọ ke isọñ edia.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ke ntak ibọọrọ mfo ado, nyọñ ufọk, ke dimọn awuọ ayịn mfo ke idem.”</char><verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Awonwaan ado amaadakka anyọñ ufọk, akekịt ayịn amọ naña ana ke ikʌk anyʌñ akịt ke dimọn amaawuọ akpọñ anye.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Inan ye Imuum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Akem Yisọs amaadakka akpọñ ñkpere Tai, asaña Sidọn, aboiyo akewuọ mben Akpainyañ Kalili, ke ufọọd adaña Dekapolis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho, Abio Duob </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Mme awo emaeben ete keed a-akedooho inan, atịmme ado imuum esọk anye, ekekpeiye anye ebo adot anye ubọk ke idem.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ke anye amaakeben awo imuum ami asịkke adakka akpọñ atu awo, Yisọs amaasịn anye nnuun ubọk ke utọñ. Ndin anye amaakọkkọ etap anyʌñ atuuk anye edeme. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ndin Yisọs amaabenne anyen ase hefịn, atuak mmịm, anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Effaatta!”</char> (a-awuọñọke <char style="wj">“Sịtte!”</char>). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Idahado, utọñ awo ado amaasịtte, udʌk edeme akịppe, ndin awo ado amaatañ ikọ mfọn-mfọn.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yisọs amaadʌt ammọ utọñ ate ke etañ enọọ awo ndomokeed. Ado naña anye akpakpan, naña ammọ ekekaiso esuan mbʌk ami. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Sia idem amaakpa ammọ eti-eti ke utọ ñkpọ ado, afịd ammọ emaedian uyio keed ete, “Anye anekke anam afịd ñkpọ afọn ama, anye anam kpa inan akop ikọ, imuum anyʌñ atañ ikọ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Anọ Awo Tọsịn Inaañ Ndidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ke ini ado atutu awo mfen emaediboho. Sia ammọ imiikinieghe se edia, Yisọs amaakoot mme mbed amọ anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" /><char style="wj">“Mbon ami ennie miin udʌk; ammọ ebaba ye ami usen ita idiaha ñkpọ ndomokeed.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" /><char style="wj">Adieke ami nnọọhọ ammọ enyọñọ ye abiọọñ, ammọ eyaesʌkkọ ke usʌñ, sia usʌk ammọ eto anyan usʌñ edi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Mme mbed emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Mmọọ ke esịd idʌñ ami ke awo akeme adinie uyo adiiyʌkkọ ammọ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yisọs amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Eboho uyo ifañ ke ndufo enie?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete “Itiaba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Anye amaabo atu awo ate esuuk etie ke isọñ. Ke anye amaakeben eboho uyo itiaba ami anọ ekọọm, anye amaabʌñ ammọ anyʌñ ayaak anọ mme mbed amọ ate edeeme enọ mme atu awo, ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ enam ntoro. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ammọ emaenie ñkeñe iyak ifañ ñko. Anye amaanyʌñ aben anọ ekọọm ndin abo yak mme mbed edeeme enọ mme atu awo. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Mme atu awo ami emaeta enyʌñ ekop uyʌkkọ. Akema mme mbed emaetañ ñyọhọnsʌhọ mbeñe a-akeyọhọke akpasa itiaba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ñkpọ nte ideen tọsịn inaañ ekeba do. Ke anye amaakenọ ammọ enyọñọ, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />anye amaakedʌk ubom ye mme mbed amọ ekaa ñkanñkʌk idʌñ e-ekoodo Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mme Farisi emaedi enyʌñ etọọñọ adibịp Yisọs mbuume. Ke adidomo anye, ammọ emaebịp anye idiọọñọ a-atooho hefịn. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Anye amaanekke asiama anyʌñ abo ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo ido ntak e-emana ami eyemme idiọọñọ? Ami ntañ ami ke akpanikọ inọ ndufo mbo, ke awo idiinọọhọ ammọ idiọọñọ ndomokeed.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ndin anye amaadakka akpọñ ammọ, atịmme akedʌk ubom akaaña ada ke edem uko.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiis mme Farisi ye ake Herọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Mme mbed emaefre adidat uyo ibọhọke eboho uyo keed a-akesịneke ke ubom. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yisọs amaadʌt ammọ utọñ ate, <char style="wj">“Inekke ikpeme idem ndufo ibaña yiis mme Farisi ye ake Herọd.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Mme mbed emaeneme ñkpọ ami ke idem ammọ ebo, “Ato ntak a-ñnyịn imiinieghe uyo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Sia anye amaakediọọñọ se ammọ ekeneme, Yisọs amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ntak a-ndufo etañña ebaña unana uyo-o? Tutu ami ndufo ikịttekịt usʌñ, ñkpọ inyʌññọ inwanwaña ndufo? Esịd ndufo a-adoro ufiọọn?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><char style="wj">Ndufo emenie anyen ado ikanna ikịt ñkpọ, e-enie utọñ ado ikanna ikop ikọ? Nte ndufo itoiyoke?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" /><char style="wj">Ke ini ami ñkebuuñọ eboho uyo ition nnọ awo tọsịn ition, mbeñe se ndufo eketañ akeyọhọ akpasa ifañ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Duob mme iba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Ke ini ami ñkebuuñọ eboho uyo itiaba nnọ awo tọsịn inaañ, mbeñe se ndufo eketañ akeyọhọ akpasa ifañ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Itiaba?”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Anye amaabo ammọ <char style="wj">“Isʌkkọ inwanwaña ndufo?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Nnan ke Bedsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ammọ emaedisịm Bedsaida, ndin mme awo emaeben nnan edikpeiye Yisọs ete atuuk anye. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Anye amaamʌm awo nnan ke ubọk, adat anye usʌñ asaña awuọ akpọñ abio ado. Ke anye amaakefiat etab ke anyen awo nnan ado anyʌñ adot anye ubọk, Yisọs amaabịp anye ate, <char style="wj">“Amekịt ñkpọ ndomokeed?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Awo ami amaadịppe anyen ase anyọñ, anyʌn abọọrọ, “Ami mmekịt mme awo, ado ammọ etie nte eto esaaña.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yisọs amaamaana adat ubọk atuuk anyen awo ado. Ndin anyen amọ amaatara, anye amaanyʌñ akịt ñkpọ mfọn-mfọn. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yisọs amaanam anye anyọñ ufọk anyʌñ abo anye, <char style="wj">“Kuudedei utịmme unyọñ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nyʌñ tañ wọt awo akeedodo ke</char></note> <char style="wj">esịd idʌñ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Atañ ke Yisọs ado Krais</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ emaekaa mme abio e-ekebaaha ke ñkanñkʌk Siseria Filipai. Ke usʌñ a-ammọ ekesañake, anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Mme awo ebo ke ami ndo anie?”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ubaak ebo, Yọọn Aduọkmmọọñ; mbon mfen ete Elaiya; ado ndusʌk mfen ebo ke afo ado keed ke atu mme prọfed.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Anye amaabịp ammọ. <char style="wj">“Ado ndufo-o? Ebo ke ami ndo anie?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pita amaabọọrọ: “Afo ado Krais.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yisọs amaadʌt ammọ utọñ ate ke etañ ewọt awo ndomokeed ibaña imọ.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Abem Iso Atañ Abaña Ñkpa Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ndin Anye amaatọọñọ adikpeep ammọ mbo ke Ayịn Awo ana abọ nsio-nsio ufen ndin ke mme ñkpisọñ eyaesịn anye, mme ikpọ aku ye mme andikpeeb mbed eyaesịn anye, eyaenyʌñ ewot anye, ndin usen ita amaaboiyo anye ayaaset. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Anye amaatañ anwa-anwa abaña ñkpa amọ, ndin Pita amaaben anye asanna ada anyʌñ atọọñọ adisua nnọọ anye.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ado ke ini Yisọs amaakekanna ise mme mbed amọ, anye amaaduat Pita ate, <char style="wj">“Setan, kanna nda miin ke edem! Afo unieghe eti akikere ubaña ñkpọ Abasi, ado akere abaña ñkpọ uduudawo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usʌñ Krọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ndin anye amaakoot atu awo ye mme mbed amọ adat anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Awo akeedodo a-ayemme iñkeene miin ana akañ idem amọ anyʌñ aben krọs amọ añkeene miin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><char style="wj">Sia awo akeedodo a-ayemme adinyaaña uwem</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek akeme adiwuọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">uwem</char><char style="ft" closed="false">me </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ukpọñ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; se ñko ke Maak 8:36, 37</char></note> <char style="wj">amọ ayaaduọọk anye, ado awo akeedodo a-aduọọhọ uwem amọ ke ntak mmi ye ke ntak eti etob ayaanyaaña anye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" /><char style="wj">Nsoo ufọn ke awo adiinie, adieke anye adiaha afịd ederimbod, ado aduọọk ukpọñ amọ?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" /><char style="wj">Me nsoo ke awo adiidat ikpʌhọ ye ukpọñ amọ?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" /><char style="wj">Awo a-akoppo abuud ambaña miin ye ikọ mmi ke emana efịbe ye idiọọkñkpọ ami, Ayịn Awo ayaakop abuud abaña anye naña anye adiidi ke ubọọñ Ete ye mme ndisana enyere.”</char><verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Anye amaanyʌñ abo ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Ami ntañ akpanikọ inọ ndufo, usʌk mbon e-edaaha mi idiikpaññake mbemiso ammọ ekịt naña abioubọọñ Abasi adi ke adudu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpəho Uduud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ke usen itiokeed amaakeboiyo Yisọs amaadat Pita, Yems ye Yọọn adọọk anyọñ ñkoñ-ñkoñ abod, a-ammọ ekebañña do ikpọọñ. Ke ndo Yisọs amaakpəho uduud ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Afọñidem amọ amaakappa ado mmịreñ-mmịreñ, ayamma, afia akan naña awo ndomokeed ke ederimbod akpekan anam anye afia. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ndin Elaiya ye Moses emaewuọ efonno, editañ ikọ ye Yisọs.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pita amaabo Yisọs ate, “Andikpeeb, afọn ñnyịn adiba mi. Yak ñnyịn ibọp atayad ita, keed unie fiin, keed anie Moses, keed anie Elaiya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Anye ikidiọọñọke se akpetañ, sia ndịk amaamʌm ammọ eti-eti.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ndin ntọñanyọñ amaawuọ afʌk ammọ, ndin uyio amaato ke ntọñanyọñ ado ate, “Anye ami ado Ayịn mmi, a-ami mmaaha. Ikpañ utọñ inọ anye!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ke ndo-ndo ado, ammọ ekekanna anyen eseet, ammọ ikikịtte awo ndomokeed aba, ibọhọke Yisọs.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Idaha a-ammọ ekesọiyọke ke abod ado, Yisọs amaadʌt ammọ utọñ ate ammọ ekuutañ unọọ awo ndomokeed se ekekịt tutu Ayịn Awo aset ke ñkpa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ammọ emaemʌm ñkpọ ami ekama ke atu idem ammọ; ado emaeka iso eneme ke atu ammọ se “adised ke ñkpa” awuọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ammọ emaebịp anye ete, “Ntak a-mme andikpeeb mbed ebooho ke ana Elaiya abem iso adi-e?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Ke aditʌm ntañ, Elaiya a-adidi, anyʌñ adineeñe afịd ñkpọ abono. Ntak e-ewette ndin ke ana Ayịn Awo abọ akpọsọñ ufen, enyʌñ esịn anye-e?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" /><char style="wj">Ado ami ntañ inọ ndufo, Elaiya a-adidi, ndin ammọ enam anye afịd ñkpọ se ammọ ekeduaduak ukem naña ekewet ebaña anye.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Akọk Etəkayịn Awodeen a-Anieghe Ndedeghe Sịbidịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ke ammọ emaekedisoobo ye mme mbed mbon ako, ammọ emaekịt nte atu awo ekanna ammọ ekʌk ye mme andikpeeb mbed nte esʌk efaaña mfaaña ye ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ke ndo-ndo ado afịd awo ekekịtte Yisọs, idem amaakpa ammọ eti-eti, ndin ammọ emaefeeñe ekekọọm anye.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo ke ndufo efaaña ye ammọ ebaña?”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Awo keed ke atu ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Andikpeeb, ami ñkedat ayịn mmi a-ndedeghe sịbidịd imiiyakka atañ ikọ ndi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Sịbidịd ado amaadịppe anye, asitop anye aduọọk ke isọñ. Efuud awuọñọ anye ke inua, anye ata eded, ndin idem amọ akappa asọọñ, anen. Ami mmaabo mme mbed mfo ebịn sịbidịd ami esio, ado ammọ ikikanna.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“O emana unana mbuọdidem. Ami ndiiba ye ndufo ñkpeene die? Ami ndiiyọ ndufo nọ akpeene die? Ben ayịn akparawa ado nsọk.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ammọ emaeben ayịn ami esọk anye. Ke ini sịbidịd ami akekịtte Yisọs, amaanam ndukpi adịppe ayịn ami. Anye amaaduọ ke isọñ, amiañña, efuud anyʌñ awuọñọ anye ke inua.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yisọs amaabịp ete ayịn ami ate, <char style="wj">“Akpeene die ayịn ami akeba ntom?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Ete ayịn amaabọọrọ ate, “Tọọñọ ke uyịn.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Amaadịppe anye, asitop anye asịn ke ikañ me mmọọñ nọ awot anye. Akpekan anie se anam, itua ñnyịn mbọm nyʌñ inyaaña ñnyịn.<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yisọs amaabo anye ate, <char style="wj">“Awuọñọ die afo adibo ‘akpekan?’ Afịd ñkpọ akeme itịppe nnọọ awo a-anịmme ke akpanikọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Idaha-idaha ado, ete ayịn ami amaatañ anwa-anwa ate, “Ami mmenịm ke akpanikọ. Ñnwam miin nọ ñkan unana mbuọdidem mmi!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ke ini Yisọs akekịtte ke atu awo efeeñe edi edise se itịppe, anye amaawuuk ndedeghe sịbidịd ate, <char style="wj">“Afo sịbidịd inan ye imuum, ami mmuwuuk fiin, wuọ ke idem ayịn ami, kuunyʌñ utịmme udʌk anye idem aba.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Idiọọk sịbidịd ami amaabọọñ ñkpo, atop ayịn ami atọ ke isọñ, anyʌñ awuọ. Ayịn ami amaakappa aba nte awo ñkpa, anam uwak awo emaebo, “Anye a-akpa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ado Yisọs amaamʌm anye ke ubọk anyʌñ adịppe anye, ndin anye amaadakka ada.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ke Yisọs amaakedʌk esịd ufọk, mme mbed amọ emaebịp anye ke ndịbe ete, “Nsoo ikiido ntak a-ñnyịn mmiikikanna ibịn ndedeghe sịbidịd ami isio?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Edat akam ye utreudia esio utọ anye ami.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">akam ye utreudia</char></note><char style="wj">”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Atañ Abaña Ñkpa Amọ Ayọhọ Akañ Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Ammọ emaekpọñ ndo enyʌñ esaña eboiyo ke Kalili. Yisọs ikiyemme awo ndomokeed adiọọñọ nte ammọ eba, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />sia anye akekpeep mme mbed amọ ñkpọ. Anye amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Eyaetap Ayịn Awo eyaak esịn ke ubọk mbon awo. Ammọ eyaewot anye, ndin ke usen ita amaaboiyo, anye ayaaset.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ado ikinwañake ammọ se anye aketañ, kpayeado ammọ emaekop ndịk adibịp anye.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ammọ emaedidʌk Kapanum. Ke ini anye akebaaha ke esịd ufọk, anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo mfaaña ke ndufo ekefaaña ke idaha e-ekesañake ke usʌñ?”</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ammọ emaedobo sia ammọ ekefaaña ebaña me anie ke atu ammọ ido andikpon ñkan.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yisọs amaasuuk atie akoot mme mbed amọ duob mme iba ate, <char style="wj">“Awo a-ayemme adido akpa ana akappa ado akpatre ye ayịnufọk afịd awo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Anye amaaben etəkayịn adaaha ke ufọọd ammọ. Ke amaakeben ayịn ado akama ke ubọk, anye amaabo ammọ ate, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><char style="wj">“Awo akeedodo a-adaarake etəkayịn ntom ke anyịñ mmi andaara miin; ñko awo akeedodo andaarake miin, idooho ami ke anye adaara, ado adaara andikindọñ miin.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awo Akeedodo i-Imiibiọọñọke Ñnyịn Ado Ake Ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yọọn amaabo Yisọs ate: “Andikpeeb, ñnyịn imaikịt awo naña adat anyịñ mfo abịn mme dimọn asio, ndin ñnyịn imaikpan anye sia anye idooho keed ke atu ñnyịn.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Kuukpan anye. Sia ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-anamma utịppeñkpọ ke anyịñ mmi a-akemeke ke etək ini ikanna ntañ idiọọk ikọ imbaña miin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><char style="wj">Ndin awo akeedodo i-imiibiọọñọke ñnyịn ada ye ñnyịn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><char style="wj">Ke akpanikọ ke ntañ inọọ ndufo, awo akeedodo i-inọọhọ ndufo kọọb mmọọñ keed ke anyịñ mmi, sia ndufo edoñño ake Krais, idiikemekekeme iduọọk utịb amọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adinam Awo Aduọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />
    <char style="wj">“Awo akpedo ñkpọiduọ anọ keed ke atu ntəkayịn ami e-ennịmme miin ke akpanikọ, akpaafọn ekpekọọñ anye ekamba itiad ke itọñ enyʌñ etop anye esịn ke akpainyañ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><char style="wj">Adieke ubọk mfo adooho ñkpọiduọ unọọ fiin, kpịkke anye duọọk. A-afọn afo adinie nsi-nsi uwem ye ubọk keed akan afo adikama ubọk mfo iba ndʌk nsi-nsi nsobo, itie i-ikañ inịmeke ke nsi-nsi,</char> [<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" /><char style="wj">ke itie</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:44">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ake utʌñ a-ataaha ammọ imiikpaññake,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:44">
    <char style="wj">ikañ ñko imiinịmeke.’</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed esịn mme ikọ atooho Maak 9:48</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />
    <char style="wj">Ñko, adieke ukod mfo keed adooho ñkpọiduọ unọọ fiin, kpịkke anye sio. A-afọn afo adidʌk uwem ke abioubọọñ nte mbʌñọ akan afo adisaña ñkpad iba ado utop fiin esịn ke nsi-nsi ikañ,</char> [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" /><char style="wj">ke itie</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:46">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ake utʌñ a-ataaha ammọ imiikpaññake,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:46">
    <char style="wj">ikañ ñko imiinịmeke.’</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed esịn mme ikọ atooho Maak 9:48</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />
    <char style="wj">Ñko, adieke anyen mfo adooho ñkpọiduọ unọọ fiin, kappa anye sio. Sia a-afọn afo adidʌk abioubọọñ Abasi ye anyen keed akan afo adisaña ye anyen iba ñkedʌk nsi-nsi ikañ,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><char style="wj">ke itie</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ake utʌñ a-ataaha ammọ imiikpaññake,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">ikañ ñko inyʌññọ inịme.’</char><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />
    <char style="wj">Eyaedomo afịd awo ke ikañ nte inʌñ.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <char style="wj">“Inʌñ a-afọn, ado adieke anye imiinieghe inem aba, afo akeme die adinam nọ anye amaana anem? Inie inʌñ ke idem ndufo, inyʌñ iba ke emem ye emọ-emọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Uwuọndọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Adikem Yisọs amaakpọñ itie ado akaa ñkanñkʌk abio Yudia, akedʌk ubom aboiyo inyañ Yọdan. Uwak mme atu awo emaemaana ekịppe ekeene anye, ñko naña ido amọ akesido, anye amaakpeep ammọ ñkpọ.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Mme Farisi ifañ, e-ekeyemme usʌñ naña emʌm anye ke ndudue, emaedibịp anye ete, “A-anen awo adisio anwaan amọ ndọ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Ndin anye amaabọọrọ ammọ ye mbuume ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo ke Moses akiwuuk ndufo?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ammọ emaebo anye, “Moses amaanyịmme abo awodeen awet ñwed uwuọndọ, ndin ebe asịn anwaan amọ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Moses akewet mbed ami inọ ndufo ato isọñesịd ndufo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" /><char style="wj">Ado tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ ederimbod Abasi akebot ammọ ‘awodeen ye awonwaan.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><char style="wj">‘Ke ntak ami, awodeen ayaakpọñ ete ye eka amọ anyʌñ akediana ye anwaan amọ,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed inieghe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anyʌñ akediana ye anwaan amọ</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" /><char style="wj">ndin ammọ awo iba, eyaekappa edo abʌk keed.’ Ke ntoro ammọ idooho awo iba aba, ado edido abʌk keed.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" /><char style="wj">Ke ntoro, se Abasi amaakedian, yak awo akuudiañña.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ke ammọ emaekesịm ufọk, mme mbed amọ emaemaana ebịp anye ebaña ikọ ndọ. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Anye amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Awo akeedodo a-asịnne anwaan amọ anyʌñ akedọ awonwaan mfen, a-asịn efịbe ye anye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" /><char style="wj">Ñko, anwaan a-asịnne ebe amọ anyʌñ akedọ awodeen mfen, a-asịn efịbe.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntəkayịn ye Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Mbon awo emaekoono ntəkayịn esọk Yisọs ebo yak anye adot ammọ ubọk, ado mme mbed amọ emaekpan ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yisọs akekịt ami, anye amaayat esịd anyʌñ adọkkọ mme mbed amọ ate, “<char style="wj">Yak ntəkayịn edi eñkeene miin; ikiikpan ammọ, sia abioubọọñ Abasi anie utọ ammọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><char style="wj">Ke akpanikọ ke ntañ inọọ ndufo, awo akeedodo i-imiidiibọọhọ abioubọọñ Abasi nte etəkayịn, idiikanna idʌk do.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ndin anye amaakoono nditọ ado akama ke ubọk, adot ammọ ubọk anyʌñ adiọñ ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbon Inie ye Abioubọọñ Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Naña Yisọs amaaketọọñọ isañ amọ, awodeen keed amaafeghe abịne anye anyʌñ akeduọ atọọñọ edọñ ke iso amọ. Anye amaabịp Yisọs ate, “Eti andikpeeb, nsoo ke ndiinam nọ nnie nsi-nsi uwem?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yisọs amaawọññọ abịp anye ate, “Nsoo inam nọ añkoot miin eti? Eti awo ibaaha, ibọhọke Abasi ikpọọñ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Afo amediọọñọ mme mbed: ‘Kuuwot awo, kuusịn efịbe, kuuyịp inọ, kuutie ntiense nsu, kuutʌk awo, kpono ete ye eka mfo.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Awo ado amaabo Yisọs, “Andikpeeb, mmenịm afịd mbed ami tọọñọ ke uyịn mmi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Do ke Yisọs akewuuk anyen ase anye anyʌñ ama anye, ndin abo anye ate, “Ñkpọ keed asʌhọ afo adinam. Kaa, ke nyam afịd se afo anie nyʌñ kpọñ nọ mme uweene, ndin afo ayaanie akpan inie ke abio Abasi. Ndin diñkeene miin.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Iso amaafiakka ete ami ke ini anye akoppo se Yisọs aketañ, anam anye amaanyọñ ye mfʌhọ sia anye akedo ataa imọ awo.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Akem Yisọs amaawọññọ anyen anyʌñ abo mme mbed amọ ate, “<char style="wj">Anekke asọñ eti-eti mbon inie adidʌk abioubọọñ Abasi!”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ikọ ami amaanam idem akpa mme mbed. Ado Yisọs amaamaana atañ nọ anwaña ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Nditọ, anekke asọñ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ana anọ mbon ake ebuọttọ idem ke inie</char></note> <char style="wj">eti-eti adidʌk abioubọọñ Abasi!</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" /><char style="wj">Ado mmem-mmem ñkpọ kamel adiboiyo ke adudu abiaween akan imọ awo adidʌk abioubọọñ Abasi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ikọ ami amaanam idem anenekke akpa mme mbed, tutu ammọ ete anye, “Anie awo ndin adiikeme inie adinyaaña?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yisọs amaawuuk anyen ase ammọ anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Awo ikanna inam ami, ado idooho ntoro ye Abasi; ibaaha ñkpọ se isọñ ikan Abasi adinam.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ndin Pita amaasịo uyio ate anye, “Ñnyịn imikpọñ afịd ñkpọ ukeene fiin.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye: <char style="wj">“Ntañ akpanikọ inọ ndufo, ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-akpọññọ ufọk me nditọeka ideen me nditọeka ibaan me eka me ete me nditọ me inwañ ke ntak mmi ye ukwọrọ eti etob</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" /><char style="wj">i-imiidiibọọhọ utịb akañ ikie uwak-uwak ke emana ami: Mme ufọk, nditọeka ideen, nditọeka ibaan, mme eka, nditọ ye mme ikọd inwañ, adiana ye ukọbọ, amaana anie nsi-nsi uwem ke ini iso.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><char style="wj">Ado uwak mme aboiyo iso eyaekappa ekpe edem, ndin mme akpeedem eyaekappa eboiyo iso.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Amaana Atañ Ayọhọ Akañ Ita Abaña Ñkpa Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ammọ emaetọọñọ isañ ekaa Yeruselem ndin Yisọs akedo andidat ammọ usʌñ. Idem amaakpa mme mbed, ndin mbon e-ekekeeneke ke edem emaekop ndịk. Anye amaamaana aben mbed duob mme iba asịkke ada, anyʌñ adọkkọ ammọ mme ñkpọ mme ñkpọ se idiitịppe inọ anye. Anye amaabo ate, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" /><char style="wj">“Ñnyịn ika Yeruselem, ndin eyaeyaak Ayịn Awo esịn ke ubọk mme ñkpoon aku ye mme akpeeb mbed. Ammọ eyaebiere ikpe ñkpa enọ anye, eyaenyʌñ eyaak anye enọ mme Gentile,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" /><char style="wj">e-ediidọọñ anye ndọk, etọọñ anye etab, emia anye enyʌñ ewot anye. Usen ita amaaboiyo anye ayaamaana aset.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebeeñe Yems ye Yọọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ndin Yems ye Yọọn, nditọ ideen Sebidi emaedi ebịne anye, ekebo ete, “Andikpeeb, ñnyịn iyem afo anam inọ ñnyịn se adodo a-ñnyịn ubeeñeke fiin.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Anye amaabịp ammọ <char style="wj">“Nsoo ke ndufo eyem ami nnam inọ ndufo?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ammọ emaebo anye, “Nam nọ awo ñnyịn keed atie ke ubọk nnasia mfo, keed ke ubọk ufiin ke ubọọñ mfo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo idiọọñọke se ndufo ebeeñe. Ndufo ekpaekan enwọñ kọọb ufen a-ami ndiinwọñ, me adibọ utọ uduọkmmọọñ a-ami ndiibọ?”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete: “Ñnyịn ikpaikan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ, <char style="wj">“Eyaenwọñ kọọb a-ami ndiinwọñ, enyʌñ ebọ uduọkmmọọñ a-ami ndiibọ,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" /><char style="wj">ado amaado aditie ke ubọk nnasia mmi, me ke ufiin, anye ado isịneke ke adudu mmi adinam. Mme itie ado enie mbon e-ekebeeñeke mme itie ado enịm enọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ke ini mme mbed duob ako ekekoppo ñkpọ ami, ammọ emaeyat esịd ataa eti-eti ye Yems ye Yọọn. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yisọs amaakoot ammọ abok anyʌñ abo, <char style="wj">“Ndufo emediọọñọ ebo ke atu mme Gentile mme adaiwuod efọfʌnnọ ammọ, ndin mme ñkpisọñ ammọ ewọt adudu a-ammọ edatta ekaara ammọ. </char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><char style="wj">Inaaha ado ntoro ye ndufo. Utu ke ado, awo a-ayemme adikpon ke atu ndufo ana ado ayịnufọk ndufo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" /><char style="wj">Awo a-ayemme ido aboiyo iso ke atu ndufo ana adʌk afʌn anọ afịd ndufo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" /><char style="wj">Sia Ayịn Awo ikidiighe ibo edinam ñkpọ enọ anye, ado akedi nọ adinam ñkpọ anọ ubon awo, anyʌñ adiyaak uwem amọ nte ñkpọufak anọ mme awo.”</char><verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batimus Awo Nnan Akịt Usʌñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Akekem ammọ emaedi Yeriko. Nte Yisọs ye mme mbed amọ ye uwak atu awo ekekpọññọ abio ado, Batimus (a-awuọñọke “ayịn Timus”), a-akedooho nnan, amaatie do ke mben usʌñ abeeñe ebeeñe. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ke ini anye akekoppo ke akedo Yisọs awo Nasared, anye amaatọọñọ adibọọñ ñkpo ate, “Yisọs, Ayịn Defid, ntua miin mbọm!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Uwak awo emaesua enọ anye, ete anye akʌp inua, ado anye amaaneenekke abọọñ, “Ayịn Defid, ntua miin mbọm!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yisọs amaasọñ ada anyʌñ abo ate, <char style="wj">“Ikoot anye.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Ndin ammọ emaekoot awo nnan ami enyʌñ ebo anye ete, “Sọọñ idem! Dakka da! Anye asʌk ukoot.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ke aditop afọñ anyọñidem amọ nduọk, anye amaatamma, ada ke ukod anyʌñ abịne Yisọs.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yisọs amaabịp anye ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo ke afo ayem nọ ami nnam unọ fiin?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Awo nnan ado amaabo ate, “Andikpeeb, ami ñyem adikịt usʌñ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Kaa, mbuọdidem mfo ukọk fiin udọñọ.”</char> Ke ndo-ndo ado, anye amaakịt usʌñ anyʌñ akeene asaña ye Yisọs ke usʌñ.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Adʌk Yeruselem nte Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Naña ammọ ekekpereke Yeruselem enyʌñ ediwuọ Betfas ye Betani a-abaaha ke Abod Ọlif, Yisọs amaadọñ mbed amọ iba ate: <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" /><char style="wj">“Ikaa ke idʌñ a-adaaha ke iso ndufo ko; imaisʌk idọdʌk eyaekịt abaak dọñki naña ayịre, a-adooho kpaanam awo ndomokeed iwatta, itat anye inyʌñ iben anye idi mi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" /><char style="wj">Awo ndomokeed akpibịp, ‘Ntak enamma ntoro-o,’ ‘Idọkkọ anye ibo ke Abọọñ ayem, ndin idiikpeeneke, ayaanọ anye eben etịmme edi.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ammọ emaekaa ekekịt abaak dọñki ke akpọusʌñ nte etobo ke mben anyenusʌñ. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Ke ammọ eketatta dọñki ami, mme awo e-ekedaaha emaebịp ammọ ete, “Nsoo inam nọ etat abaak dọñki ado?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ naña Yisọs aketemme ammọ. Ndin mme awo ado emaeyaak ammọ eben dọñki edakka. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ammọ emaeben abaak dọñki ami edinọ Yisọs enyʌñ esịññe afọñ anyọñidem ammọ ebịt ke edem amọ ndin Yisọs amaadọọk atie. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Uwak awo emaebịt afọñ anyọñidem ammọ ke akpọusʌñ, ke ini mbon mfen ekebịtte mme ñkọk eto a-ammọ ekekpịkkeke ke mme inwañ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Mbon se ikisaña ke iso ye mbon se ikikeene ke edem emaekwaaha ñkpo enyʌñ ebọọñ ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana ato usem Hibru awuọñọke “Nyaaña” akema adido ikọ itooro; se ñko ke Maak 11:10</char></note>”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Afọfọn anọ anye a-adiighe ke anyịñ Abọọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Adidiọñ anie adidi abioubọọñ ete ñnyịn Defid!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Hosana ke ataa anyọñ hefịn.”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yisọs amaadʌk Yeruselem adọọk akaa ke mme esịd akwere tembịd. Anye amaakanna anyen aseet afịd ñkpọ, ado sia ayio amaakesọñ, anye amaaboiyo akaa Betani ye mbed amọ duob mme iba.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Asuuñọ Eto Fik anyʌñ Abịn mme Awo Asịññe ke Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Edem usen ado, idaha a-ammọ ekekpọññọ Betani, abiọọñ amaadọñ Yisọs. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Anye akeda akịt eto fik nte ayọhọ ye mfañ ke nsan-nsan, anye amaasaña akpere akese me anwịm idem. Anye akekesịm ndo, anye akekịt ke mfañ ikpọọñ ayịre, sia ikidooho ini e-eto ami asinwịmme. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ndin anye amaasuuñọ eto ami ate, <char style="wj">“Awo ndomokeed idiikịppeke mfịd mfo aba idia ke nsi-nsi.”</char> Mme mbed amọ emaekop ini a-anye atañña ikọ ami.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ke ammọ emaekesịm Yeruselem, Yisọs amaadʌk ke mme esịd akwere tembịd anyʌñ atọọñọ adibịn mbon e-ekedeppe ñkpọ ye mbon e-ekenyamma ñkpọ do. Anye amaakanna mme akpokoro mme akpəho akʌk atọọñ ye mme ñkpọitie mbon e-ekenyamma ibiom, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ikinyʌññọ iyak awo ndomokeed aben ñkpọ udua asaña aboiyo ke mme akwere tembịd. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ndin ke ini anye akekpeebe ammọ ñkpọ, anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ado nte awo iwette ibo: ‘Eyaekoot ufọk mmi ufọk ubọñ akam ake afịd idịd’? Ado ndufo emeben anye enam ‘afe mbon inọ.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Mme ñkpoon aku ye mme nta akpeeb mbed ekekop ami, emaetọọñọ adiyem usʌñ naña ekpeda ewot anye, ado ammọ ekebaabaak anye ke ntak ukpeebñkpọ amọ, sia idem amaakpa atu awo ekekoppo ukpeebñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Amaakediwuọ ndubiayio, Yisọs ye mme mbed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">amaakediwuọ, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yisọs</char></note> amọ emaekpọñ abio ado.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ke ayio amaakesiere, naña ammọ ekesañake ke usʌñ, ammọ emaekịt ke eto fik ado amaayeppe atọọñọ ke adʌñ. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pita amaatoiyo anyʌñ abo Yisọs ate, “Andikpeeb, kase! Eto fik a-afo akesuuñọke ayeeme mfañ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ, <char style="wj">“Nie mbuọdidem ke Abasi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><char style="wj">Ke akpanikọ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">“Adieke afo anieghe mbuọdidem ke Abasi,” Yisọs amaabọọrọ, </char><char style="fv" closed="false">23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ke akpanikọ</char></note> <char style="wj">ke ami ntañ inọọ ndufo, adieke awo akeedodo abooho ekamba abod ami, ‘Dakka ke top idem mfo sịn ke akpainyañ,’ anye miinyʌññọ inie eyịghe ke esịd amọ, ado anịm ke akpanikọ ke se anye atañ ayaatịppe, eyaenam enọ ammọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" /><char style="wj">Ke ntoro, ami idọkkọ ndufo, se adodo a-ndufo ebọññọ akam ebeeñe, inịm ke akpanikọ ke emebọbọ enie, ndin eyaebọ se ndufo ebeeñe ado.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><char style="wj">Ñko ndufo imaida adibọñ akam, adieke enieghe utọk ye awo ndomokeed, ifeen inọ awo ado nọ Ete ndufo a-abaaha ke hefịn afeen mme idiọọkñkpọ ndufo.</char> [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><char style="wj">Ado adieke ndufo imiifeene inọ awo mfen, Ete ndufo a-abaaha ke hefịn idiifeene mme idiọọkñkpọ a-ndufo enamma inọ ndufo.”</char>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed esịn mme ikọ se iba ke Matiu 6:15.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyem Adidiọọñọ nte Yisọs Adat Adudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ammọ emaemaana ediwuọ Yeruselem, ndin ke ini Yisọs akesañake ke mme akwere tembịd, mme ñkpoon aku, mme akpeeb mbed, ye mme ñkpisọñ emaedi ebịne anye. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Ammọ emaedibịp anye ete, “Adudu akee ke afo adat anam mme afịd ñkpọ ami? Ñko anie akunọọ fiin adudu adinam se afo anam ami?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ami ñko ñyaibịp ndufo mbịme keed. Imbọọrọ miin, ndin ami ñyaidọkkọ ndufo nte ami ndat adudu nnañña mme ñkpọ ami.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" /><char style="wj">Uduọkmmọọñ Yọọn, me aketo hefịn me aketo awo? Itañ innọ miin.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Ammọ emaedọñọ adu ke idem ammọ ete, “Mmimọ ikpibo, aketo hefịn, anye ayaibịp, ‘Ntak a-ndufo imiikinịmme anye ke akpanikọ-ọ?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ado ñnyịn ikpibo, ‘Aketo awo.’ ” (Ammọ ekebabaak atu awo, sia afịd awo emaenịm ke Yọọn akedo ayọhọ prọfed.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ndin ammọ emaebọọrọ anye ate: “Ñnyịn idiọọñọke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yisọs amaabọọrọ ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Ami ndiinyʌññọ ntañ inọ ndufo nte ami ndat adudu nnam mme ñkpọ ami.”</char><verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ñke mme Atọinwañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ndin Yisọs amaatọọñọ aditañ ikọ nnọọ ammọ ke ñke, ate: <char style="wj">“Awo keed aketọ inwañ fain. Anye amaabọp ndibene akanna inwañ ado, atịppe ube unyịmme ukọd anyʌñ abọp itie ukpeme. Anye amaaben inwañ ami anọ mme atọinwañ ate ekpeme, ndin adakka akaa isañ ke itie mfen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" /><char style="wj">Ini idọk akedikem anye amaadọñ ayịnufọk ate aka akebọ mme atọinwañ ami ubaak mfịd ke inwañ fain.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Ado ammọ emaemʌm ayịnufọk ami, etịm anye, enyʌñ enọ anye anyọñ ubọk-ubọk.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" /><char style="wj">Akem anye amaamaana adọñ ayịnufọk mfen aka abịne ammọ; ammọ emaemia anye ado iwuod enyʌñ esuenne anye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Anye amaamaana anọ awo mfen aka, anye ami ammọ emaemʌm ewot. Anye amaanọ uwak mbio mfen, ado ammọ etetịm usʌk, enyʌñ ewowot usʌk.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />
    <char style="wj">“Anye amaanie awo keed a-akesʌhọke anye adidọñ, ayịn amọ awodeen, a-anye akemaaha. Anye akenọ anye aka akpatre, abo ate, ‘Ammọ eyaekpono ayịn mmi.’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Ado mbon e-ekenọọhọ inwañ ekama emaetie edioomo ye emọ-emọ ete, ‘Adiaakpa amọ ado ami. Idi, yak ñnyịn iwot anye, ndin udeeme ñkpọ amọ ayaakappa ado ake ñnyịn.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" /><char style="wj">Ndin ammọ emaemʌm anye ewot, etop akpo amọ esio ke inwañ fain ado.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />
    <char style="wj">“Nsoo ndin ke andinie inwañ fain ami adiinam? Anye ayaadi adiwoot mbon e-ekekamake inwañ fain ado, anyʌñ aben inwañ fain ado anọ mbon mfen.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><char style="wj">Nte ndufo ikoodo se ewet ke itie Ñwed Abasi ami ete,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Itiad a-mme abọbufọk ekesịnne</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">akappa ado itiad inuuk.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />
    <char style="wj">Abọọñ anam ami,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">ndin anye ado utịppe ñkpọ ke anyen ñnyịn.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ndin mme ñkpoon aku, ye mme akpeeb mbed ye mme ñkpisọñ emaeyem usʌñ naña ekpesaña emʌm anye, sia ammọ emaediọọñọ ke anye aketop ñke ami ibaña mmimọ. Ado ammọ ekebaak atu awo; ado anam ammọ emaedakka ekpọñ anye enyọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpe Taks Nnọọ Ukara Sisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Akem ammọ emaedọñ ubaak mme Farisi ye mbon nsaña Herọd ebịne Yisọs nọ ekemʌm anye ke ikọ inua amọ. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Mbon ami emaekaa ekebo anye ete, “Andikpeeb, ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke afo ado awo akpanikọ, awo ikanna aduben fiin ntịn usʌñ sia afo ubaaha awo anyen, ado afo akpeep usʌñ Abasi ke akpanikọ. Nte anen ñnyịn adikpe taks<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asaña-asaña taks ukara mbon ekebaaha ke idak ukara Sisa ekesikpeeghe, ado mme amanaisọñ Rom ikisikpeeghe</char></note> ukara nnọọ Sisa, me inenne? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ado se ikpe, me itre adikpe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Ado Yisọs amaadiọọñọ ñkara ye mbubịk esịd ammọ. Anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ntak a-ndufo ekọọhọ afia ennọ miin-e? Iben akʌk ado idi nọ ami nse.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ammọ emaeben akʌk edi. Anye amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndise anie awo ido ami? Anyịñ anie awo ke ewet ami?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete, “Ake Sisa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ndin Yisọs amaabo ammọ: <char style="wj">“Iyaak ñkpọ se inie Sisa inọ Sisa, ndin se inie Abasi iyaak inọ Abasi.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Idem amaakpa ammọ eti-eti abaña anye.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udọ Ndọ ke Ini Adiset ke Ñkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Ndin mme Sadusi, e-ebooho ke adised ke ñkpa ibaaha, emaeben mbuume ebịne Yisọs ete, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Andikpeeb, Moses amaawet abo, awodeen akpekpa akpọñ anwaan ado ibonno nditọ, ayịneka amọ awodeen ana aben ebekpa anwaan ado adọ nọ abon nditọ anọ anye. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Nditọeka ideen itiaba ekeba. Akpa awo amaadọ anwaan, akpa, inieghe ayịn. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ayọhọ iba amaaben ebekpa anwaan ayịneka adọ, ado anye ñko amaakpa inieghe ayịn. Ukem ado aketịppe anọ ayọhọ ayịneka awodeen ita. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ke aditʌm ntañ, ndomokeed ke atu nditọeka itiaba e-ekedọọhọ awonwaan ami a-akenieghe ayịn ato anye ikibaaha. Ke akpatre, awonwaan ami amaanyʌñ adikpa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ke ini adised ke ñkpa, anwaan anie ke atu ado ke anye adiido, sia naña awo itiaba emaedọ anye?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ikịtte ke ndufo emenam ndudue sia ndufo idiọọñọke ikọ Abasi inyʌññọ idiọọñọ adudu Abasi?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Mme akpañkpa emaeset, ammọ idiidọọhọ ndọ idiinyʌññọ inọ ke ndọ; ammọ ediitie nte mme enyere ke hefịn.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><char style="wj">Ke abaña mme akpañkpa ediset, ado nte ndufo ikoodo ke ñwed Moses, ke mbʌk i-ikañ aketaaha ikọd, naña Abasi akebo Moses ate, ‘Ami ndo Abasi Ebraham, Abasi Aisik, ye Abasi Yekọb?’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" /><char style="wj">Anye idooho Abasi mme akpañkpa, ado Abasi mme aduuwem. Ndufo emenam ataa akpan ndudue!”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akaakan Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Keed ke atu mme andikpeeb mbed a-akediighe abịne Yisọs amaakop nte ammọ esʌk efaaña mfaaña. Anye akekop ke Yisọs amaanọ ammọ nnekke-nnekke ibọọrọ, amaabịp anye abo, “Ke atu afịd mme mbed, akee ado akaakan?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ ate, <char style="wj">“Andikpon ñkan ke afịd mbed ado ami: ‘Kop, O Isrel: Abọọñ Abasi ñnyịn ado keed.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" /><char style="wj">Ima Abọọñ Abasi ndufo ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo ye ke afịd akikere ndufo ye ke afịd adudu ndufo.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" /><char style="wj">Ayọhọ iba ado ami: ‘Ima mbọhọidʌñ ndufo nte idem ndufo.’ Ibaaha mbed a-akponno akan mbon ami.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Awo ami amaabọọrọ ate, “Andikpeeb, akpanikọ ke afo atañ, ado ataa nnen-nnen afo adibo ke Abasi ado keed, ke mfen ibaaha ke mmiibọhọke anye. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Adima anye ke afịd esịd mfo ye ke afịd ifiọk mfo, ye ke afịd adudu mfo, anyʌñ ama mbọhọidʌñ mfo nte idem mfo, a-akpon akan afịd ufọfọb uwa ye mme nsio-nsio uwa mfen.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Ke ini Yisọs amaakekịt ke anye amaabọọrọ ye ayọhọ aniọñ, anye amaabo anye ate: <char style="wj">“Afo unyọọñọ usʌñ ukpọñ abioubọọñ Abasi.”</char> Ndin tọọñọ ke idaha ado kaa iso awo ndomokeed ikideeghede ibịp anye mbịme mfen aba.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Krais Ado Ayịn Anie?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ke ini Yisọs akesʌkkọ akpeep ñkpọ ke mme akwere tembịd, anye amaabịp ate, <char style="wj">“Nsoo ido ntak nọ mme andikpeeb mbed ebo ke Krais ado ayịn Defid?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><char style="wj">Defid ke idem amọ, ke ini atañña ikọ ato ke adudu Adisana Sịbidịd, amaabo anwa-anwa ate:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Abọọñ amaabo Abọọñ mmi ate,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">“Tie ke ubọk nnasia mmi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">tutu ami nsịn mme asua mfo</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">ke idak ñkpad mfo.” ’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />
    <char style="wj">Defid ke idem amọ akoot anye ‘Abọọñ.’ Anye akpenam die ndin ado ayịn Defid?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Uwak atu awo emaekpañ utọñ ekop ikọ amọ ye inemesịd.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndʌdutọñ e-Enọọhọ mme Andikpeeb Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Naña Yisọs akekpeebe ñkpọ, anye amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ikpeme mme andikpeeb mbed sia ammọ ema adisịne ñweem-ñweem afọñ nsaaña ke efaak, enyʌñ eyem afịd awo etuak iwuod ekpono ammọ ke anwa udua,</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" /><char style="wj">enyʌñ ema mme ñwuọnda itie ke mme sinakọk ye mme itie ukpono ke mme itie usọrọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" /><char style="wj">Ammọ ema adifuuk mme ebekpa mbọi ufọk, enyʌñ ewọt idem ke edibọñ ñnyan akam. Mme utọ ibon ami eyaebọ ataa akpọsọñ ufen.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enọ Ebekpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yisọs amaasuuk atie ke nsakiso akebe usịn enọ anyʌñ ase naña mbon awo esịn enọ ke itie unịmñkpọ tembịd. Uwak mme imọ awo emaesịn uwak akʌk. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ado ebekpa keed a-akedooho uweene amaasịn ataa akpatre akʌk amọ, kọbọ iba a-akesịppe akan afịd akʌk.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yisọs amaakoot mme mbed amọ anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ke akpanikọ ke ami idọkkọ ndufo nte ke uweene ebekpa ami a-asịn akʌk ke akebe usịn enọ akan afịd mbon ñko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" /><char style="wj">Afịd ammọ ekenọ ubaak ke atu uwak inie ammọ, ado awonwaan ami, ke idaha uweene amọ, amaaben afịd se anye akpedat adu uwem adinọ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Uwuud Tembịd ye mme Idiọọñọ Utịd Ayio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ke Yisọs akesañake awuọ akpọñ tembịd, mbed amọ keed amaabo anye, “Andikpeeb, kap se mme ikpọ aniendịk itiad ami, ye utọ ikpọ mfọọn ufọk ami!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo emekịt afịd mme ñkpoon ufọk ami? Ndomo itiad ami keed idiisọññọ idoro ke emọ-emọ; eyaetoomo afịd ammọ eduọọñọ ke isọñ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Naña Yisọs aketieghe ke Abod Ọlif, ke nsakiso tembịd ado, Pita, Yems, Yọọn ye Andru emaebịp anye ke atu idem ammọ ete, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tañ inọ ñnyịn ini akee ke mme ñkpọ ami ediitịppe. Nsoo idiido idiọọñọ ke mme ñkpọ ami eyaesọp edisu?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Do ke Yisọs akebo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Inekke ikpeme mbaak awo ndomokeed adiben ndufo awakka akpọñ usʌñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" /><char style="wj">Sia uwak awo eyaewuọ edi ke anyịñ mmi, edibo ndufo ete, ‘Ami ndo anye,’ eyaenyʌñ enam uwak awo ewakka ekpọñ usʌñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Ndufo imaikop ibaña ekọñ ye etob ekọñ, ikiiyak nọ esịd ndufo atịmede. Mme ñkpọ ami ana edat itie, ado idooho idiọọñọ utịd ini adodo; utịd idiwuọhọ diin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" /><char style="wj">Idịd ayaanwana ye idịd, abioubọọñ ayaanwana ye abioubọọñ. Mme unyeñisọñ eyaeba ke mme itie mme itie, akañ ayaaba. Mme ñkpọ ami edoñño idiọọñọ ntọọñọ ubiak uman.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <char style="wj">“Ana ndufo enekke ekpeme idem ndufo. Eyaikappa ndufo esịn ke ubọk mme ukara ntək abio enyʌñ imia ndufo ikpa ke mme sinakọk. Eyaidaaha ndufo ke ikpe ke iso mme adaukara ye mme ndidem nọ ndufo edo ntiense enọ ammọ ke ntak mmi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" /><char style="wj">Ndin nte akpa ñkpọ, ana ekwọrọ eti etob enọ afịd mme idịd.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" /><char style="wj">Ini keed akeedodo i-imʌmmọ ndufo eben eka ikpe, ikiikere me nsoo ke ediitañ inyaaña idem. Itañ kpa se Abasi itemme ndufo kpa idahado, sia idooho ikọ ndufo ke ediitañ; ado ikọ Adisana Sịbidịd.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Ayịneka ayaatap ayịneka anọ ñkpa, ñko ete ayaanyʌñ atap ayịn amọ anọ ñkpa. Nditọ eyaedakka eda enwana ye mme ete ye mme eka enyʌñ enam ewot ammọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><char style="wj">Afịd awo eyaisua ndufo ke ntak mmi, ado awo a-asọọñọke ada akewuọ utịd ayaanie adinyaaña.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Ndin ndufo imaikịt naña ‘Mbubiam ñkpọ a-adatta nsobo adi,’ abaaha</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">anye</char>
    </note> <char style="wj">ke itie i-imiikpibaaha, yak awo a-akoodo ñwed ami anekke adiọọñọ se awuọñọ; idahado yak mme andiba ke Yudia efeeñe ekaiya ikpọabod.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><char style="wj">Ke awo ndomokeed a-adoroke ke anyọñ akọm ufọk asọiyọ ayem adikidʌk ufọk ñkeben ñkpọ ndomokeed nsio.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" /><char style="wj">Ke awo ndomokeed a-abaaha ke inwañ atịmme akaa ufọk akeben afọñ ufʌkidem amọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" /><char style="wj">Ado, mbọm ibaan e-esañake ye idịb ye ibaan e-esʌkkọ enọnọ mme nsekayịn eba ke utọ mme usen ado!</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" /><char style="wj">Ikap ibọñ akam ite yak ñkpọ ntịppe ami akuudo ke ini akpọsọñ atueb,</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><char style="wj">sia mme usen ado ediido ini ukuud; utọ a-adooho kpaanam ibaaha tọọñọ ke aditọọñọ, ke ini a-Abasi akebotto ederimbod tutu awuọ idahami; idiinyʌññọ ibaba aba.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Ndin mmiikpidooho a-Abọọñ Abasi akenamma mme usen ado eməho, awo ndomokeed ikpibọkkọke. Ado ke ntak mme ndimek ikọd Abasi, anye a-anam mme usen ado eməho.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" /><char style="wj">Ke ini ado awo ndomokeed akpibo ndufo, ‘Se mi, se Krais mi!’ me, ‘se, se anye ko!’ ikiinịm ke akpanikọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" /><char style="wj">Uwak mme nsu-nsu krais ye mme prọfed nsu eyaewuọñọ edi enyʌñ edinam mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ nọ ebiaña mme awo, ammọ ekpekan, kpa ye mme andimek Abasi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" /><char style="wj">Ke ntoro, iba ke ñkpemeidem sia ami mmebabak ntañ afịd ñkpọ inọ ndufo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Ado, ke mme usen ukuud ado emaeboiyo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘utịn ayaakappa ekịm,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">afiọñ idiinyʌññọ inọ unwana,</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />
    <char style="wj">mme ntantaafiọñ ñkọ eyaeto ke anyọñ eduọññọ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">ñko eyaenyeeñe mme adudu ke mme hefịn.’</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />
    <char style="wj">“Ke ini ado, afịd awo eyaekịt Ayịn Awo naña adi ke ntọñanyọñ ye ayọhọ adudu ye ubọọñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" /><char style="wj">Ndin anye ayaadọñ mme enyere amọ edikoono mme andimek ikọd amọ eto ke inuuk afịm inaañ, atọọñọ ke ataa utịd ederimbod tutu awuọ utịd mme hefịn.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Ndin, ndufo idat ukpeebñkpọ ito eto fik: Anye amaasịññe nseghe ñkọk, amaana ko mme mfañ ewuọñọ, edat ado ediọọñọ ke ndaayio akpere.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" /><char style="wj">Kpayeado, ndufo imaikịt afịd mme ñkpọ ami naña atịppe, eyaediọọñọ ebo ke</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">anye</char></note> <char style="wj">adikpere, mmọdo kpa ke inuausʌñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" /><char style="wj">Ntañ akpanikọ inọ ndufo, emana ami idiiboiyoke ifep mbemiso mme ñkpọ ami etịppe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" /><char style="wj">Anyọñ ye isọñ eyaeboiyo efep, ado tutu amama mme ikọ mmi idiiboiyoke ifep.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awo Idiọọñọke Usen me Awa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <char style="wj">“Amaado usen ado, me awa ñkanika ado, awo ndomokeed idiọọñọke; kpak mme enyere ke hefịn, me Ayịn, ke imiibọhọke Ete ikpọọñ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Inekke iba ke mbeeñeidem, inekke itịñ anyen</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ewet, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">itịñ anyen inyʌñ ibọñ akam</char></note><char style="wj">! Sia ndufo imiidiọọñọke ini adidi Ayịn Awo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><char style="wj">Atie nte awo akpọñ ufọk aka isañ; ayaak adudu ke ufọk anọ nditọufọk abo ekpeme; adeeme utom anọ ammọ keedekeed; anyʌñ adọkkọ akpeme inuaatob ate anekke akpeme.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />
    <char style="wj">“Ke ntoro ikpeme, sia imiidiọọñọke ini a-anieufọk adiinyọñ idi; me adiido ndubiayio me ke ufọọd akonayio; me ke akikọunen akpọkkọ me ke usiere.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" /><char style="wj">Anye akpedi adiwad-adiwad, ikiiyak adikịt ndufo nte edadaiya.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" /><char style="wj">Se ntañ inọọ ndufo, ami ntañ ado nnọ afịd awo: ‘Ikpeme.’ ”</char><verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Eyet Yisọs Adan ke Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Akesʌhọ usen iba mbemiso adikem usen Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ye Usọrọ Uyo a-yiis miisịneke; ndin mme ñkpoon aku ye mme andikpeeb mbed emaeyem ñkara-ñkara usʌñ naña ekpeda emʌm Yisọs ndịbe-ndịbe ñnyʌñ ñwot anye. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ammọ emaedioomo ke atu idem ammọ ete ke inaaha emʌm anye ke idaha usọrọ ado mbaak atu awo edinam ntịme.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Idaha a-anye akebaaha ke Betani, anyʌkkọ abere ke akpokoro ndidia ke ufọk Saimọn awo Akpamfia, awonwaan keed amaadʌk adi, akama ataa nsọñudua pefium ke ekpeme alabasta e-ekedatta naad enam. Awonwaan ado amaakʌppọ ekpeme pefium ado aduọk Yisọs ke iwuod.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Usʌk awo ke ufọk ado emaeyaat esịd eti-eti ke atu idem ammọ, ete, “Nsoo inam nọ ebiat utọ nsọñudua pefium ami? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Pefium ado a-akem se ekpenyam anye abọhọ akʌkutom afiọñ isua keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">akan denari ikie ita</char></note> enyʌñ eben akʌk ado enọ mme uweene.” Ndin ammọ emaenekke esua enọ mma ado.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ado Yisọs amaabo ammọ ate: <char style="wj">“Ikpọñ anye. Nsoo ido ntak a-ndufo efịnake anye? Anye anam ataa eti ñkpọ annọ miin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" /><char style="wj">Mbon uweene ediisʌk ibaba ye ndufo afịd ini, ndin ini a-ndufo emaahama emekeme adinwam ammọ. Ado ndufo idinnieghe miin afịd ini.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" /><char style="wj">Awonwaan ami amaanam se anye akekan. Anye amaabem iso amfiọññọ miin pefium ke idem ke mbeeñeidem ini e-ediimbuuk miin.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" /><char style="wj">Ami ntañ akpanikọ inọ ndufo, itie akeedodo e-ediikwọrọ eti etob ke afịd ederimbod eyaetañ se anye anam ami enyʌñ edat ado etoiyo anye.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Akekem Yudas Iskariọd, keed ke atu mme mbed duob mme iba, amaadakka abịne mme ñkpoon aku akenam edioomo adiitap Yisọs nnọọ ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Esịd amaanem ammọ eti-eti naña ekoppo, ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ enwọñọ adinọ anye akʌk. Ndin anye amaatọọñọ ayem ufañ naña ada atap anye anọ ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ndidia Ndubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ke akpa usen Usọrọ Uyo a-yiis imiisịneke, a-akenaaha esiwa edọñ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, mme mbed Yisọs emaebịp anye ete, “Ayem ñnyịn ika uke ikinam ndutʌm nọ afo uduudia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ndin anye amaadọñ mbed amọ iba ate ammọ, <char style="wj">“Ikaa esịd abio, ndin eyaekịt awodeen keed nte akama abañ mmọọñ. Ikeene anye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" /><char style="wj">Ndin ufọk a-anye adiidʌk, ibo anieufọk ado ke Andikpeeb abo, ‘Ubeed isen mmi a-ami ndiidia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ye mme mbed mmi ado akee?’</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" /><char style="wj">Anye ayaiwọt ndufo ekamba ubeed ke anyọñ e-emaekebeeñe enịm. Inam ndutʌm do inọ ñnyịn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Mme mbed ado emaekaa ekedʌk abio, enyʌñ ekekịt ukem-ukem naña Yisọs akebo ammọ. Ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ enam ndutʌm Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Akedo ndubiayio, Yisọs amaadiwuọ ye mme mbed duob mme iba. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ke ini ammọ ekebonoke ekanna akpokoro edia ndidia, Yisọs amaabo, <char style="wj">“Ke akpanikọ ke ntañ inọọ ndufo, awo keed ke atu ndufo, a-adiaha ñkpọ mi ye ami, ayantap miin.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ammọ emaefʌhọ, ndin ke adiana ke adiana, emaebịp anye ete, “Mmenịm ke idooho ami ke akọm?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ndin anye amaabọọrọ ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ado awo keed ke atu ndufo, anye a-adiideep uyo ke usan ndidia ye ami.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" /><char style="wj">Ayịn Awo ana anyọñ, kpa naña ewet ebaña anye. Ado adọdiọọk anọ awo a-adiitap Ayịn Awo. Akpaakefọn ye awo ado adieke anye imiikpikimanakemana.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ke ini ammọ ekesʌkkọ edia ñkpọ, Yisọs amaaben uyo, ndin ke anye amaakenọ ekọọm, anye amaabuuñ anọ mme mbed amọ, ate, <char style="wj">“Ibọ ami ita; ami ado ikpọkidem mmi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Akem anye amaaben kọọb, ke anye amaakenọ ekọọm, ayaak anọ ammọ, ndin afịd ammọ emaenyʌñ enwọñ.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Anye amaabo ammọ <char style="wj">“Ami ado iyiib ufa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ufa ado</char></note> <char style="wj">edioomo mmi, e-eduọkkọ enọ uwak awo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" /><char style="wj">Ke akpanikọ ke ntañ inọọ ndufo nte, ami ndinwọññọ se ito mfịd fain aba, tutu awuọ usen a-ndiitịmme ñnwọñ anye ufa ke abioubọọñ Abasi.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ke ammọ emaekekwọ ikwọ ema, afịd ammọ emaewuọñọ ekaa Abod Ọlif.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs Ayaara ke Pita Ayaikañ Imọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Akem Yisọs amaabo mme mbed amọ ate: <char style="wj">“Afịd ndufo eyaefeeñe eñkpọñ miin akonayio ami, sia e-ewet ebo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ami ñyaayʌppọ akpemeedọñ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">ndin mme edọñ eyaesuana.’</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ado ami mmaaset ke ñkpa, ami ñyaibem ndufo iso ñkaa Kalili.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pita amaatañ anwa-anwa ate anye, “Ñkọm afịd awo ekpukpọñ fiin, ami nduukpọññọ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yisọs amaabọọrọ anye ate, <char style="wj">“Ke akpanikọ ke ntañ unọọ fiin, mfịn ami, kpa idem akonayio ami, mbemiso akikọunen akpọk ñkemba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed inieghe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ñkemba</char></note> <char style="wj">afo ayañkañ miin ñkenta.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ado Pita amaasọọñọ ayịre atañ ate, “Akpedo ana ñkpa ye afo, ami nduukañña fiin.” Ndin afịd mme mbed mbon ako ekesʌk etañ kpa ukem ado.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kedsemeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ammọ emaedaaña ekaiya itie akereke Kedsemeni, ndin Yisọs amaabo mme mbed amọ ate, <char style="wj">“Itie mi imbet, yak ami ñkebọñ akam.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Anye amaadat Pita ye Yems ye Yọọn akaa, ndin idem amaatọọñọ adifịna anye eti-eti; anye amaanyʌñ akop akpọsọñ mfʌhọ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ndin anye amaasio adọkkọ ammọ abo, <char style="wj">“Ukpọñ mmi afʌhọ eti-eti akpere ñkpa. Isuuk itie mi, inyʌñ itaba idab.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Anye akesaña adọọk etək, amaaduọ ke isọñ abọñ akam ate adieke usʌñ abaaha, yak awa ado aboiyo akpọñ anye. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Anye amaabo, <char style="wj">“<char style="tl">Abba,</char></char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abba awuọñọ </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ete</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke usem Aramaik</char></note> <char style="wj">Ete, afo amekan adinam afịd ñkpọ. Ben kọọb ami sio nnọ miin. Ado yak ke ado naña ami ñnyịmme, yak ado naña afo anyịmme.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Anye amaato adi adikịt ke mme mbed esʌk edaiya. Ndin anye amaabịp Pita ate, <char style="wj">“Saimọn, afo adaadaiya? Ukpusʌkkọ ukan utaba idab utie ukpeme ye ami ukpọk awa keed?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" /><char style="wj">Itaba idab inyʌñ ibọñ akam mbaak ndufo ididʌk ke idomo. Sịbidịd a-anyịmme, ado ikpọkidem a-akop mmemidem.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ini keed mfen, anye amaatịmme akebọñ akam, amaana abọñ kpa ukem akam ado. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Anye aketịmme adi, amaadikịt ke ammọ esʌk edadaiya, sia idab amaaneke adʌk ammọ anyen. Ammọ ikidiọọñọke se ekpebọọrọ anye.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Akem anye amaamaana adi ayọhọ akañ ita, adibo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ndufo esʌk edaadaiya enyʌñ eduọk adudu? Akem! Awa ado adikem. Sese, e-ekappa Ayịn Awo esịn ke ubọk mme anam idiọọkñkpọ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" /><char style="wj">Idaaña ida! Yak ika! Andibiintap miin adiwuọ!”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emʌm Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Kpa ke idaha a-anye akesʌkkọ atatañ ikọ ke inua, Yudas, keed ke atu mbed duob mme iba, amaawuọ atịkke. Anye akesaña ye atu awo e-ekekamake mme eduad ye mme akpeti, a-mme ñkpoon aku, mme akpeeb mbed, ye mme ñkpisọñ ekedọññọ.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Awo a-akebooho itap anye amaanọ ammọ idiọọñọ, “Awo a-ami ndiitʌm inua ado awo ado; imʌm anye iben ikaa, inekke ikpeme anye.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ini keed, Yudas amaakaa abịne Yisọs kpa ke ndo-ndo ado, akebo anye, “Andikpeeb,” anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ideen ado emaefiik Yisọs emʌm. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Awo keed ke atu ado a-akedaaha akpere amaasio akañkañ akpi ayịnufọk ekamba aku utọñ akpịkke.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yisọs amaabịp ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ado nte ami ndo adaiwuod mme asịn ntịme nọ ndufo ewuọ embịne miin ye mme eduad ye mme akpeti edi edimmʌm miin?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><char style="wj">Ami ñkeba ye ndufo kwa usen, ñkpeep ñkpọ ke mme akwere tembịd, ado ndufo ikimmʌmmọ miin. Ado mme ñkpọ ami etịppe nọ ikọ Abasi asu.”</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ndin ke idahado, afịd awo emaekpọñ anye efeeñe.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Akparawa keed a-akewañake isịn afọñ linen ke idem, amaakeene Yisọs. Ke emaekemʌm Yisọs, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />anye amaafeghe ifed akpọñ afọñ linen amọ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisọs ke Esob Sanhidrin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ammọ emaeben Yisọs ekaa atʌñ ekamba aku, afịd mme ikpọ aku ye mme ñkpisọñ, ye mme akpeeb mbed emaebono do. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pita amaakeene Yisọs ke edem akedʌk esịd akwere ekamba aku. Anye amaakesuuk atie ye mbon ukpeme ekamba aku awue ikañ.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Afịd mme ñkpoon aku ye afịd mbon esob Sanhidrin emaeyem ikọ ntiense se etañ edian Yisọs nọ ediikan iwot anye, ado ikikịtte. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Uwak mme ntiense nsu emaewuọñọ edidot anye uyio, ado ikọ ammọ ikidukemmeke.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Akem usʌk awo emaedaaña eda etañ ikọ ntiense nsu edian anye: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />Ñnyịn imaikop nte anye abo, “Ami ñyaawuut tembịd ami, e-ekedatta ubọkawo ebọp ndin ke usen ita amaaboiyo ñyaabọp mfen, a-awo imiidatta ubọk ibọp.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ndin kpayeado, ikọ ntiense ammọ ikisañake keed.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Do ke ekamba aku akedakka ada ke ufọọd esob, abịp Yisọs ate, “Afo uyemme adibọọrọ mbuume? Nsoo ikọ ntiense ke mme awo ami etañ udian fiin?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ado Yisọs ikisioho uyio, inọọhọ ibọọrọ ndomokeed.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Ekamba aku amaamaana abịp anye ate, “Afo ado Krais, Ayịn Abasi Anye e-Emaekediọñ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yisọs amaabo anye, <char style="wj">“Ami ke ado, ndin ndufo eyaekịt naña Ayịn Awo atie ke ubọk nnasia Akwa Abasi, ye naña anye adiidi ke ntọñanyọñ hefịn.”</char><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ekamba aku amaawai afọñidem amọ, anyʌñ abo atu awo, “Nsoo ntiense mfen ke iyem aba? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ndufo emekop atịme-atịme nsuukuyio ikọ emiom se anye atañ. Idahado, ndufo ekere die?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Afịd ammọ emaebiom anye ikpe, ete ke anye adot ñkpa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ndin usʌk awo emaetọọñọ aditọọñ anye etab; emaefʌk anye ñkịm ke anyen; etọ anye eta, enyʌñ ebo anye ete, “Tañ prọfesi!” Akem mbon ñka ukpeme emaeben anye ewuọ enyʌñ ekemia anye.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita Akañ Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Idaha a-Pita akesʌkkọ aba ke esịd akwere ekamba aku, ayịn abọikpa keed a-akedooho ayịnufọk ekamba aku amaadʌk adi. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Anye akekịt Pita nte awue ikañ, amaawuuk anyen ase anye, ate, “Afo ñko akedo nsaña Yisọs, awo Nasared ado.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ado anye amaakañ ate, “Ami ndiọọñọke, inyʌññọ iñnwaña se afo atañ abaña.” Ndin Pita amaadakka akpọñ esịd akwere awuọ esiin. Ndin akikọunen amaakpọk.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ke ini ayịnufọk ekamba aku akekịtte anye ke ndo, anye amaamaana adọkkọ mbon se ikida ikpere ate, “Awo ami ado keed ke atu ammọ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Anye amaamaana akañ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Ke etək ini amaakeboiyo, mbon awo se ikida ke ndo emaekebo Pita ete, “Ke akpanikọ, afo ado awo keed ke atu ammọ, afo ado awo Kalili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Pita amaatọọñọ adikoot isuuñọ, anyʌñ anwọñọ ñkpọ ate, “Ami ndiọọñọke awo a-ndufo etañña ikọ ebaña.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ataa idahado, akikọunen amaakpọk ayọhọ akañ iba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed inieghe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akañ iba.</char></note> Ndin Pita amaatoiyo ikọ a-Yisọs aketañña anọ anye abo, <char style="wj">“Mbemiso akikọunen akpọk akañ iba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme akpa ikpañwed inieghe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akañ iba</char></note> <char style="wj">afo ayañkañ miin ñke nta.”</char> Ndin esịd amaabʌññọ anye, anye amaanyʌñ atua.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs ke Iso Pailed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Tuhi-tuhi ubakusen, mme ñkpoon aku ye mme ñkpisọñ ye mme andikpeeb mbed ye afịd mbon Sanhidrin, emaenam edioomo ammọ. Ndin ammọ emaebọp Yisọs, eben anye esaña ekeyaak enọ Pailed.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Ndin Pailed amaabịp anye ate, “Afo ado adidem mme Yuu?” Ndin Yisọs amaabọọrọ Pailed ate,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">
    <char style="wj">“Ado naña afo atañ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Mme ñkpoon aku emaedot anye uwak-uwak ikọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pailed amaatịmme abịp anye ate “Ado nte afo uyemme adibọọrọ? Se utọ afịd uwak ikọ se ammọ etañ udot fiin.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ado Yisọs ikisʌkkọ ibọbọọrọ, anam idem amaakpa Pailed eti-eti.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ke ini usọrọ, akesido ido Pailed adisisaana awo ñkpakọb keed akeedodo a-mbon idʌñ eyemme nnọọ ammọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ndin amaaba awo keed a-akekereke Barabas, a-akebaaha ke ñkpakọb ye mbon mfen e-ekesịnne ntịme ke abio, kpa ye mbon e-ekewoodo awo ke ntịme ado. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ndin atu awo emaedi ebịne Pailed edibeeñe anye ete anam naña anye asʌk asinam ke ini usọrọ ntom.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Ntom ke Pailed akebịp ammọ ate, “Ndufo ebo ñyaak adidem mme Yuu inọ ndufo?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Anye akebịp mbuume ami sia anye amaadiọọñọ abo ke ntak ufọn idem ammọ akenam mme ñkpoon aku ekeyaak Yisọs inọ imọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ado mme ñkpoon aku emaedọọñ atu awo ete ebo Pailed asaana Barabas ayaak.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pailed ndin amaatịmme abịp ammọ ate, “Ndufo ebo nnam nsoo ndin ye anye a-ndufo ekoodo adidem mme Yuu?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Afịd ammọ emaedọñ uyio keed ebọñ ete, “Kọñ anye ke krọs!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pailed amaabịp ammọ, “Ntak-a? Nsoo idiọọkñkpọ ke anye anam?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ado ammọ emaenenekke ebọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ete, “Kọñ anye ke krọs!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pailed, ke adiyem adinem atu awo esịd, amaasaana Barabas ayaak anọ ammọ. Anye amaanam emia Yisọs, ndin asaana anye ayaak anọ ammọ ate eben ekekọñ ke krọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbon Ekọñ Enọ Yisọs Ñnyọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Mbon ekọñ emaeben Yisọs ewuọ edʌk esịd akwere, (ado ado Pretorium) enyʌñ ekoot udịm mbon ekọñ ediyọhọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Ammọ emaesịn anye ewịra, a-akebaaha iduud-iduud, ndin emaedọk anyanya ñkukịm eyat anye ke iwuod. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ndin ammọ emaetọọñọ iben anye ntọọñ ndọk, ete, “Itọñ uwem asọñ adidem mme Yuu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ammọ emaeben esañ eyʌppọ anye iwuod emaana eyʌppọ, enyʌñ ekọkkọ etab etọ anye. Akema, emaetọọñọ edọñ etuak iwuod enọ anye. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ke ammọ emaekesuenne anye ema, ammọ emaesio anye iduud-iduud afọñ ewịra enyʌñ eben afọñidem amọ esịn anye. Ndin ammọ emaeben anye ewuọ ekaa adikọñ ke krọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekọñ Yisọs ke Krọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Saimọn, ete Aleksanda ye Rufọs, a-akedooho awo Siriin, amaato esịd abio ayem adisaña mboiyo, ado ammọ emaemʌm anye enam anye abiom krọs Yisọs. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ammọ emaeben Yisọs ekaa Kọlkọta (a-awuọhọ “itie ñkpọkpọrọ”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Akema ammọ emaeben ukọd e-ewuaha ye atidod mee enọ anye, ado anye ikibọọhọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ndin ammọ emaekọñ anye ke krọs, edeeme afọñidem amọ, ke emaekesịn ukañ adidiọọñọ me akee afọñ ke awo keedekeed adiidat.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Akedo ñkanika usʌkkeed ubakusen ke ammọ ekekọñ anye ke krọs. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ndin ammọ emaewet ikọ ubiomikpe edian ke krọs, ete:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">
    <char style="sc">“Adidem mme Yuu.”</char><verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ammọ emaekọñ mme ndiọi awo iba ke krọs ediana anye, keed ke ubọk nnasia, keed ke ufiin. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Ntom ke ikọ ñwed Abasi e-ekewette ebaña anye akesu: “Ndin emaebat anye esịn ke atu mme anam idiọọkñkpọ.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed esịn mme ikọ mi abitte se isịne ke Luk 22:37</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mbon se ikisaña iboiyo do emaesueñ anye, efuuñ iwuod, ete, “Afo a-aduakka adiwuut tembịd ñnyʌñ mbọp ke usen ita, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />sọiyọ ke krọs di nyaaña idem mfo!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kpa ke ukem usʌñ ado, mme ñkpoon aku ye mme akpeeb mbed ke atu idem ammọ ñko emaesaha anye, ete, “Anye amaanyaaña mbon mfen, ado ikanna inyaaña idem amọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Yak Krais ami, Adidem Isrel ami, asọiyọ adi ke krọs, nọ ñnyịn ikịt inyʌñ inịm anye ke akpanikọ.” Mbon e-ekekọññọ ke krọs ediana anye emaekeene esueñ anye.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ke ñkanika duob mme iba uweemeayio, ekịm amaafʌk afịd isọñ tutu ñkanika ita uweemeayio. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ndin ke ñkanika ita uweemeayio Yisọs amaabọñ ke akpọsọñ uyio ate, <char style="tl"><char style="wj">“Eloi, Eloi, lema sabaktani?”</char></char> (a-awuọñọke, <char style="wj">“Abasi mmi, Abasi mmi, nsoo inam nọ afo añkpọñ miin?”</char>)<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ke ini usʌk mbon se ikida ikpere ekekoppo, ammọ emaebo, “Kop, anye akoot Elaiya.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Awo keed amaafeghe akedat kusa, anyiin ke fineka atot ke eto anyan anọ Yisọs ate anwọñ. Akem awo ado amaabo ate, “Ikpọñ anye ndin. Yak ise me Elaiya ayaadikọññọ anye ke eto.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ke Yisọs amaaketua ke akpọsọñ uyio, anye amaaduọk akpatre ibifịk amọ.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Afọñ ikpeghe ke esịd tembịd amaasakka mbaak iba, tọọñọ ke anyọñ tutu awuọ isọñ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ke ini sentudiọn, etubom mbon ekọñ a-akedaaha do ke iso Yisọs akekịtte naña anye akekpa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed ewet </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akekịtte </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ke anye amaakpa ye akpọsọñ ayịd</char></note> anye amaabo ate: “Ke akpanikọ, awo ami akedo Ayịn Abasi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Usʌk ibaan mmọdo ekeda nsan-nsan ese se ikitịppe. Ke atu ammọ ekedo Mmeri Makdalin, ye Mmeri eka etək-etək Yems ye Yosef<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yosef</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yoses; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">se ñko ke Maak 15:47</char></note> ye Salomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Mme ibaan ami ekesisaña ye Yisọs ese ñkpọ ebaña anye idaha a-anye akebaaha ke Kalili. Uwak ibaan mfen e-ekesañake ye anye eto Yeruselem edi emaeba do ñko.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuuk Yisọs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Akedo ke Usen Mbeeñeidem (a-adooho usen keed mbemiso asiere usen Sabad). Ndin akedikpere ndubiayio, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosef awo Arimatia, ekamba awuọiso awo ke ekamba Esob mme Yuu, a-anye ke idem amọ aketieghe abet ini adidi abioubọọñ Abasi, amaabịne Pailed uko-uko akebo anye inọ akpo Yisọs. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Idem amaakpa Pailed adikop ke Yisọs amaakpakpa. Pailed amaadọñ ekoot sentudiọn, ndin amaabịp me Yisọs amaakpakpa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ke anye amaakekop ito sentudiọn ke Yisọs amaakpa, anye amaayaak akpo amọ anọ Yosef. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ndin Yosef amaakedep afọñ linen, akekọññọ akpo Yisọs awañ ke linen ado, anyʌñ aben akesịn ke udi e-ekekappa ke itiad. Ndin anye amaakpat itiad akwe inua udi ado. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mmeri Makdalin ye Mmeri eka Yosef emaekịt itie e-ekebuuhọ anye.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yisọs a-Aset ke Ñkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ke usen Sabad amaakeboiyo, Mmeri Makdalin, Mmeri eka Yems, ye Salomi emaekedep anemufịk adan nọ eben ekefiọññọ akpo Yisọs. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Tuhi-tuhi ubakusen ke akpa usen udua, idaha u-utịn aketọọñọke adinyan iso, ammọ emaedika udi <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />ndin ammọ emaeneme ye emọ-emọ ete, “Anie adiikikpat itiad isio ke inua udi?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ado ammọ ekedịppe anyen ese, ammọ emaekịt ke emaekpakpat itiad a-akenekkeke akpon esio ke inua udi. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ke ini ammọ ekedʌkkọ esịd udi, ammọ emaekịt akparawa keed a-akesịneke anyan afia afọñidem naña atie do ke ubọk nnasia, ndin ndịk amaamʌm ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Anye amaabo ammọ ate, “Ikiikop ndịk. Ndufo eyem Yisọs Ayịn Nasared e-ekekọññọ ke eto. Anye a-aset! Anye ibaaha mi. Idi idise itie e-ekenịmme anye. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ado ikaa ikidọkkọ mme mbed amọ ye Pita ibo, ‘Anye i-ibem ndufo iso akaa Kalili. Do ke ndufo ediikikịt anye kpa naña anye akidọkkọ ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ke ñnyeñidem ye ñkpaidem, ibaan ado emaefeeñe ewuọñọ ke udi Yisọs. Ammọ ikitañña ikọ inọ awo ndomokeed, ato naña ndịk akenam ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="iex">[Mme ataa ñkaan ñwed ye mme ñkaan ntiense inieghe ufañ 9-20.]</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ke Yisọs amaakeset ubakusen ke akpa usen ke udua, anye amaato ayaara idem anọ Mmeri Makdalin, awonwaan a-anye akebịnne dimọn itiaba asịññe ke idem. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Mmeri Makdalin ndin amaakaa akedọkkọ mbon e-ekesibaaha ye anye, e-ekebonoke ke mfʌhọ ye ntuaayịd. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ke ammọ ekekoppo ke anye amaaset, ke anye mmọ ke uwem, ke Mmeri amaakịt anye, ammọ ikinịmme ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ndubiayio usen ado, anye amaayaara idem anọ awo ammọ iba ke usʌñ naña esañake eka abioinwañ; ado ammọ ikidiọọñọke anye sia anye amaakpəho idem asịn ke uduud mfen. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ndin ammọ emaekaa eketañ enọ mbon ñko; ado ndomo awo ammọ keed ikinịmme ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Akekem Yisọs amaayaara idem anọ mme mbed duob mme keed ke itie a-ammọ ekebonoke edia ndidia. Anye amaasua anọ ammọ ke isọñesịd a-ammọ ekenieghe ye ke unana adinịm mbon e-ekekịtte anye ke anye amaakeset ekeditañ enọ ammọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Anye amaabo ammọ ate, <char style="wj">“Ikaa ke afịd ekondo inyʌñ ikikwọrọ eti etob ami inọ afịd emana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><char style="wj">Awo a-anịmme ke akpanikọ, anyʌñ abọ uduọkmmọọñ, eyaenyaaña anye, ado awo a-atreke adinịm ke akpanikọ, ikpe ayaabiom anye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><char style="wj">Ndin mme idiọọñọ ami eyaekeene mbon se inịm ke akpanikọ: ke anyịñ mmi ammọ eyaebịn mme dimọn; eyaesem ufa usem;</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><char style="wj">ammọ eyaemʌm udʌkikọd ke ubọk, ndin adieke ammọ enwọññọ ibọk ñkpa, idiinamma ammọ idiọọk; ammọ eyaedot mbon udọñọ ubọk ndin ammọ eyaekop nsọñidem.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ke Abọọñ Yisọs amaaketañ ikọ inọ ammọ, emaeben anye edọọk hefịn, anye anyʌñ akesuuk atie ke ubọk nnasia Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ndin mme mbed emaewuọñọ ekekwọrọ ikọ ke afịd itie, Abọọñ amaanyʌñ adat ammọ anam utom, anyʌñ asọọñọ ukwọrọikọ ammọ ke adinam mme idiọọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>